    "website": "https://www.appliedmaterials.com",
    "ceo": "Gary E. Dickerson",
    "full_time_employees": "36500",
    "description": "Applied Materials, Inc. engages in provision of materials engineering solutions used to produce semiconductors. The firm also focuses on design, development, production, and servicing of the critical wafer fabrication tools used for customers to manufacture semiconductors. It operates through the following segments: Semiconductor Systems and Applied Global Services (AGS). The Semiconductor Systems segment includes designing, development, manufacturing and sale of equipment used to fabricate semiconductor chips referred to as integrated circuits. The AGS segment engages in provision of services, spares, and factory automation software to customer fabrication plants globally. The company was founded on November 10, 1967 and is headquartered in Santa Clara, CA.",
    "description_en": "Applied Materials, Inc. engages in provision of materials engineering solutions used to produce semiconductors. The firm also focuses on design, development, production, and servicing of the critical wafer fabrication tools used for customers to manufacture semiconductors. It operates through the following segments: Semiconductor Systems and Applied Global Services (AGS). The Semiconductor Systems segment includes designing, development, manufacturing and sale of equipment used to fabricate semiconductor chips referred to as integrated circuits. The AGS segment engages in provision of services, spares, and factory automation software to customer fabrication plants globally. The company was founded on November 10, 1967 and is headquartered in Santa Clara, CA.",
    "description_zh": "應用材料公司 (Applied Materials, Inc., AMAT) 為全球半導體產業提供領先的材料工程解決方案，其核心宗旨是透過創新技術，支援新世代晶片的生產與進步。公司業務涵蓋半導體製造所需之關鍵晶圓生產設備的設計、開發、製造及全球售後服務。\n\n其營運主要劃分為兩大事業體：\n\n【半導體系統部門 (Semiconductor Systems)】：此部門專責研發、生產與銷售用於製造積體電路 (Integrated Circuits, IC) 晶片的先進設備。這些設備是生產記憶體、邏輯晶片、AI處理器及其他高性能半導體元件不可或缺的基石，廣泛應用於行動裝置、資料中心、人工智慧等領域。\n\n【應用全球服務部門 (Applied Global Services, AGS)】：主要業務為全球晶圓廠客戶提供全方位的營運支援。內容包括設備維護與優化服務、備用零組件的即時供應，以及提升生產效率與良率的廠房自動化軟體解決方案。\n\nAMAT 憑藉其深厚的技術積累與廣泛的全球服務網絡，持續在半導體製程技術領域扮演關鍵角色，推動產業創新與永續發展。",
