    "description": "Autodesk, Inc. delivers advanced software and services for 3D design, engineering, and entertainment to a global clientele. Their diverse product line includes AutoCAD Civil 3D, a comprehensive solution for civil engineering tasks such as land development, transportation infrastructure, and environmental projects. For construction project management, they offer BIM 360, a cloud-based platform. Core design and drafting needs are met by AutoCAD and its specialized counterpart, AutoCAD LT. The company also provides CAM software, essential for computer numeric control (CNC) machining, inspection, and manufacturing modeling, alongside Fusion 360, an integrated platform for 3D CAD, CAM, and computer-aided engineering. Autodesk further provides curated Industry Collections, offering comprehensive toolsets for professionals in architecture, engineering, and construction (AEC), product design and manufacturing (PDM), and media and entertainment sectors. Their offerings extend to Inventor, a robust suite for 3D mechanical design, simulation, analysis, tooling creation, visualization, and documentation; and Vault, their data management solution, designed to centralize information, expedite design workflows, and enhance collaboration. For advanced 3D modeling, animation, special effects, rendering, and compositing, they provide Maya and 3ds Max. Additionally, ShotGrid serves the media and entertainment industry as a cloud-based platform for review processes and production tracking. Autodesk distributes its offerings both directly to customers and through an extensive network of authorized resellers and distributors. Established in 1982, the company is headquartered in San Rafael, California.",
    "description_en": "Autodesk, Inc. delivers advanced software and services for 3D design, engineering, and entertainment to a global clientele. Their diverse product line includes AutoCAD Civil 3D, a comprehensive solution for civil engineering tasks such as land development, transportation infrastructure, and environmental projects. For construction project management, they offer BIM 360, a cloud-based platform. Core design and drafting needs are met by AutoCAD and its specialized counterpart, AutoCAD LT. The company also provides CAM software, essential for computer numeric control (CNC) machining, inspection, and manufacturing modeling, alongside Fusion 360, an integrated platform for 3D CAD, CAM, and computer-aided engineering. Autodesk further provides curated Industry Collections, offering comprehensive toolsets for professionals in architecture, engineering, and construction (AEC), product design and manufacturing (PDM), and media and entertainment sectors. Their offerings extend to Inventor, a robust suite for 3D mechanical design, simulation, analysis, tooling creation, visualization, and documentation; and Vault, their data management solution, designed to centralize information, expedite design workflows, and enhance collaboration. For advanced 3D modeling, animation, special effects, rendering, and compositing, they provide Maya and 3ds Max. Additionally, ShotGrid serves the media and entertainment industry as a cloud-based platform for review processes and production tracking. Autodesk distributes its offerings both directly to customers and through an extensive network of authorized resellers and distributors. Established in 1982, the company is headquartered in San Rafael, California.",
    "description_zh": "歐特克 (ADSK) 專精為全球客群提供三維 (3D) 設計、工程與娛樂領域的尖端軟體解決方案與服務。其產品組合多元，核心業務橫跨建築、工程、營造 (AEC)、產品設計與製造 (PDM) 及媒體娛樂產業。\n\n在工程建設領域，公司提供 AutoCAD Civil 3D 支援土木規劃，並透過雲端平台 BIM 360 強化營建專案管理。基礎設計製圖工具為 AutoCAD 系列。針對製造業，則有電腦輔助製造 (CAM) 軟體支援數值控制 (CNC) 加工，旗下 Fusion 360 更整合了 3D 電腦輔助設計 (CAD)、製造 (CAM) 與工程 (CAE) 功能。\n\n歐特克亦提供專為 AEC、PDM 及媒體娛樂專業人士打造的「產業集合」(Industry Collections)。其他核心產品包括用於 3D 機械設計、模擬與分析的 Inventor，以及加速設計流程與協作的數據管理平台 Vault。在媒體娛樂領域，Maya 與 3ds Max 專精於 3D 建模、動畫、視覺特效與渲染，而 ShotGrid 則提供雲端協作與生產追蹤服務。\n\n公司透過直銷及廣泛的經銷夥伴體系觸及市場，其營運模式奠基於訂閱制軟體授權與雲端服務，持續鞏固在數位設計與工程領域的領導地位。",
