    "ceo": "Shane Trigg",
    "full_time_employees": "1702",
    "description": "AppFolio, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, provides cloud-based platform for the real estate industry in the United States. The company provides a cloud-based platform that assist with accounting, reporting, marketing, leasing, maintenance, workflow automation, and communication services. It offers AppFolio Property Manager Core, a platform that provides the accounting functionalities for small property management companies, as well as serves as a system of record; AppFolio Property Manager Plus, which offers affordable housing and student housing, advanced accounting, advanced data analysis, and read-only API access services; and AppFolio Property Manager Max that provides customer relationship management tools and full database access through a read and write application programming interface services. The company also provides value-added services, such as electronic payment, tenant screening, maintenance, business optimization, resident, and risk mitigation services. It serves property managers, property investors, potential residents, residents, and vendors. AppFolio, Inc. was incorporated in 2006 and is headquartered in Santa Barbara, California.",
    "description_en": "AppFolio, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, provides cloud-based platform for the real estate industry in the United States. The company provides a cloud-based platform that assist with accounting, reporting, marketing, leasing, maintenance, workflow automation, and communication services. It offers AppFolio Property Manager Core, a platform that provides the accounting functionalities for small property management companies, as well as serves as a system of record; AppFolio Property Manager Plus, which offers affordable housing and student housing, advanced accounting, advanced data analysis, and read-only API access services; and AppFolio Property Manager Max that provides customer relationship management tools and full database access through a read and write application programming interface services. The company also provides value-added services, such as electronic payment, tenant screening, maintenance, business optimization, resident, and risk mitigation services. It serves property managers, property investors, potential residents, residents, and vendors. AppFolio, Inc. was incorporated in 2006 and is headquartered in Santa Barbara, California.",
    "description_zh": "AppFolio Inc. (APPF) 的核心業務係為美國房地產產業提供基於雲端技術的整合性管理平台。該平台旨在優化物業管理效率，涵蓋會計、財務報告、行銷推廣、租賃管理、設施維護、工作流程自動化及多方通訊等關鍵營運環節。\n\n公司產品線依客戶需求劃分為不同層級：\n1.  **AppFolio Property Manager Core**：主要針對小型物業管理公司，提供核心會計功能與作為系統記錄（system of record）之基礎平台。\n2.  **AppFolio Property Manager Plus**：此進階版本支援平價住宅與學生宿舍市場，提供更複雜的會計處理、進階數據分析及唯讀應用程式介面（API）存取權限。\n3.  **AppFolio Property Manager Max**：最高階版本，整合客戶關係管理（CRM）工具，並透過讀寫應用程式介面（API）提供完整資料庫存取能力。\n\n此外，AppFolio亦提供一系列加值服務，包含電子支付處理、租戶背景調查、維修管理、業務效能優化、住戶服務及風險規避方案等。其服務對象廣泛，涵蓋物業經理、房地產投資者、潛在租客、現有租客及供應商。此營運模式主要透過SaaS訂閱與加值服務費用，實現多元化營收。\n\n（215 字）",
