    "description": "Broadridge Financial Solutions, Inc. delivers specialized technology and communication services designed for the financial sector. Its Investor Communication Solutions division is responsible for processing and disseminating proxy materials for equity securities and mutual funds, streamlining associated voting procedures. Furthermore, it circulates vital regulatory disclosures, details on class actions and corporate reorganizations, and comprehensive tax reporting services. Notable offerings include ProxyEdge, an electronic proxy delivery and voting system. The company also provides data-centric solutions and a holistic platform for content creation, management, and multi-channel delivery of regulatory, marketing, and transactional content, alongside mutual fund transaction processing and advanced data analysis tools. This segment offers tailored services for public companies and investment funds, encompassing support for SEC filings and capital market transactions, registrar functions, stock transfer, and meticulous record-keeping. It also develops integrated customer communication strategies, all powered by its Broadridge Communications Cloud platform for creating and managing client engagement. The Global Technology and Operations segment streamlines the entire transaction workflow, from initial order to final settlement, across a wide array of asset classes, such as equities, mutual funds, fixed income instruments, foreign exchange, and exchange-traded derivatives. Its services encompass areas like order capture and execution, trade confirmation, margin management, cash flow, clearance and settlement, reference data, reconciliations, securities financing, collateral management, asset servicing, regulatory compliance, portfolio accounting, and custody. This segment also provides outsourced business operations, sophisticated technological tools covering portfolio management, compliance adherence, fee billing, and overarching operational support, as well as specialized solutions for capital markets and wealth management firms. Established in 1962, the company maintains its headquarters in Lake Success, New York.",
    "description_en": "Broadridge Financial Solutions, Inc. delivers specialized technology and communication services designed for the financial sector. Its Investor Communication Solutions division is responsible for processing and disseminating proxy materials for equity securities and mutual funds, streamlining associated voting procedures. Furthermore, it circulates vital regulatory disclosures, details on class actions and corporate reorganizations, and comprehensive tax reporting services. Notable offerings include ProxyEdge, an electronic proxy delivery and voting system. The company also provides data-centric solutions and a holistic platform for content creation, management, and multi-channel delivery of regulatory, marketing, and transactional content, alongside mutual fund transaction processing and advanced data analysis tools. This segment offers tailored services for public companies and investment funds, encompassing support for SEC filings and capital market transactions, registrar functions, stock transfer, and meticulous record-keeping. It also develops integrated customer communication strategies, all powered by its Broadridge Communications Cloud platform for creating and managing client engagement. The Global Technology and Operations segment streamlines the entire transaction workflow, from initial order to final settlement, across a wide array of asset classes, such as equities, mutual funds, fixed income instruments, foreign exchange, and exchange-traded derivatives. Its services encompass areas like order capture and execution, trade confirmation, margin management, cash flow, clearance and settlement, reference data, reconciliations, securities financing, collateral management, asset servicing, regulatory compliance, portfolio accounting, and custody. This segment also provides outsourced business operations, sophisticated technological tools covering portfolio management, compliance adherence, fee billing, and overarching operational support, as well as specialized solutions for capital markets and wealth management firms. Established in 1962, the company maintains its headquarters in Lake Success, New York.",
    "description_zh": "Broadridge Financial Solutions, Inc. (BR) 專為金融產業提供專業的科技與通訊服務。\n\n其【投資人溝通解決方案】部門，負責處理並發送股票與基金的股東會委託書及開會通知，簡化股東投票流程。同時，提供重要法規遵循資訊揭露、團體訴訟、企業重組通知與全面稅務處理服務。核心產品為電子化委託書遞送與投票系統 ProxyEdge。此部門並提供資料導向解決方案、多元管道內容平台（涵蓋法規、行銷與交易內容的創建、管理與發送），支援基金交易處理及高階資料分析。為上市公司與投資基金提供客製化服務，涵蓋美國證交會申報、資本市場交易、股務代理、股務過戶與帳務維護；其整合性客戶溝通策略由 Broadridge Communications Cloud 平台驅動。\n\n【全球技術與營運解決方案】部門，優化股票、基金、固定收益證券、外匯及集中市場衍生性金融商品等多元資產類別的完整交易流程，從訂單捕捉到最終結算。服務範圍包括訂單捕捉與執行、交易確認、保證金管理、現金流、清算交割、參考資料、帳務對帳、證券融資、抵押品管理、資產服務、法規遵循、投資組合會計及保管服務。同時提供業務流程外包服務，以及涵蓋投資組合管理、法規遵循、費用帳務處理與營運支援的精密技術工具，並為資本市場與財富管理公司提供專業解決方案。",
