    "description": "Marvell Technology, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, provides data infrastructure semiconductor solutions and spanning the data center core to network edge in the United States, Argentina, China, India, Israel, Japan, Singapore, South Korea, Taiwan, Vietnam, and internationally. The company develops and scales system-on-a-chip architectures, integrating analog, mixed-signal, and digital signal processing functionality. It offers a portfolio of ethernet solutions, including spanning controllers, network adapters, physical transceivers, and switches; single or multiple core processors; and custom application specific integrated circuits, interconnects, fibre channel adapters, and processors. The company also provides interconnect products, including pulse amplitude modulation, coherent and coherent-lite digital signal processors (DSPs), laser drivers, trans-impedance amplifiers, silicon photonics, co-packaged optics, linear pluggable optics chipsets, data center interconnect, active electrical cable DSPs and peripheral component interconnect express retimer solutions; fibre channel products comprising host bus adapters and controllers for server and storage system connectivity; storage controllers for hard disk drives and solid-state-drives; host system interfaces, including serial advanced technology attachment and serial attached SCSI, peripheral component interconnect express, compute express link switches, non-volatile memory express (NVMe), and NVMe over fabrics; and develops ultra accelerator linkTM switches and ethernet for scale-up networking switches. The company serves data centers, communications, and other markets. It offers its products through direct customers and distributors. Marvell Technology, Inc. was incorporated in 1995 and is headquartered in Wilmington, Delaware.",
    "description_en": "Marvell Technology, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, provides data infrastructure semiconductor solutions and spanning the data center core to network edge in the United States, Argentina, China, India, Israel, Japan, Singapore, South Korea, Taiwan, Vietnam, and internationally. The company develops and scales system-on-a-chip architectures, integrating analog, mixed-signal, and digital signal processing functionality. It offers a portfolio of ethernet solutions, including spanning controllers, network adapters, physical transceivers, and switches; single or multiple core processors; and custom application specific integrated circuits, interconnects, fibre channel adapters, and processors. The company also provides interconnect products, including pulse amplitude modulation, coherent and coherent-lite digital signal processors (DSPs), laser drivers, trans-impedance amplifiers, silicon photonics, co-packaged optics, linear pluggable optics chipsets, data center interconnect, active electrical cable DSPs and peripheral component interconnect express retimer solutions; fibre channel products comprising host bus adapters and controllers for server and storage system connectivity; storage controllers for hard disk drives and solid-state-drives; host system interfaces, including serial advanced technology attachment and serial attached SCSI, peripheral component interconnect express, compute express link switches, non-volatile memory express (NVMe), and NVMe over fabrics; and develops ultra accelerator linkTM switches and ethernet for scale-up networking switches. The company serves data centers, communications, and other markets. It offers its products through direct customers and distributors. Marvell Technology, Inc. was incorporated in 1995 and is headquartered in Wilmington, Delaware.",
    "description_zh": "美滿電子科技 (Marvell Technology, Inc., MRVL) 及其子公司，為全球市場提供資料基礎設施半導體解決方案，業務範疇涵蓋資料中心核心至網路邊緣。公司專精於開發與擴展系統單晶片 (SoC) 架構，整合類比、混合訊號及數位訊號處理 (DSP) 等核心功能。\n\n其產品組合多元，主要包括：\n1.  **乙太網路解決方案**：提供控制器、網路介面卡、實體收發器及交換器。\n2.  **處理器與ASIC**：涵蓋單核、多核處理器，以及客製化特殊應用積體電路 (ASIC)。\n3.  **先進互連技術**：包含脈衝振幅調變 (PAM)、相干/半相干DSP、雷射驅動器、跨阻放大器、矽光子、共同封裝光學元件 (Co-packaged Optics)、線性可插拔光學晶片組、資料中心互連，並提供主動式電纜DSP與PCIe重定時器。\n4.  **儲存與光纖通道解決方案**：供應硬碟與固態硬碟儲存控制器，以及伺服器與儲存系統連線所需的光纖通道主機匯流排介面卡與控制器，支援SATA、SAS、PCIe、CXL交換器、NVMe及NVMe over Fabrics等主機系統介面。\n5.  **網路加速器**：開發Ultra Accelerator Link™ (UAL) 交換器及用於縱向擴展網路的乙太網路交換器。\n\nMarvell 主要服務資料中心、通訊等高科技市場，產品透過直接客戶與經銷商通路銷售。公司成立於1995年，總部位於德拉瓦州威爾明頓。",
