    "description": "Palo Alto Networks, Inc. is a global leader in providing advanced cybersecurity solutions. The company's core product line includes both hardware and software-based firewalls. It also offers Panorama, a sophisticated security management platform designed for centralized control of these firewall deployments, whether they are physical appliances, virtual instances, or situated in public or private cloud environments. Additionally, the firm provides virtual system upgrades to enhance the capacity of its physical firewall units. Complementing its core products, Palo Alto Networks delivers an extensive range of subscription services. These encompass robust threat prevention, protection against malware and advanced persistent threats, URL filtering, and security for both laptop and mobile devices. Further specialized subscriptions include DNS security, Internet of Things (IoT) security, SaaS security (via API and inline methods), threat intelligence, and data loss prevention. Beyond its product and subscription offerings, the company extends various expert services, such as cloud security, secure access solutions, security analytics and automation tools, and specialized cybersecurity consulting, often integrated with threat intelligence. Its professional services cover critical areas like architectural design and planning, system implementation, configuration, and seamless firewall migration. Educational resources, including certifications and both online and in-classroom training, are also available, alongside comprehensive support services. Palo Alto Networks distributes its security solutions both directly and through an extensive network of channel partners. Its diverse clientele primarily comprises medium to large-scale enterprises, service providers, and governmental organizations across a wide array of industries. These sectors include education, energy, financial services, healthcare, internet and media, manufacturing, the broader public sector, and telecommunications. Established in 2005, Palo Alto Networks maintains its corporate headquarters in Santa Clara, California.",
    "description_en": "Palo Alto Networks, Inc. is a global leader in providing advanced cybersecurity solutions. The company's core product line includes both hardware and software-based firewalls. It also offers Panorama, a sophisticated security management platform designed for centralized control of these firewall deployments, whether they are physical appliances, virtual instances, or situated in public or private cloud environments. Additionally, the firm provides virtual system upgrades to enhance the capacity of its physical firewall units. Complementing its core products, Palo Alto Networks delivers an extensive range of subscription services. These encompass robust threat prevention, protection against malware and advanced persistent threats, URL filtering, and security for both laptop and mobile devices. Further specialized subscriptions include DNS security, Internet of Things (IoT) security, SaaS security (via API and inline methods), threat intelligence, and data loss prevention. Beyond its product and subscription offerings, the company extends various expert services, such as cloud security, secure access solutions, security analytics and automation tools, and specialized cybersecurity consulting, often integrated with threat intelligence. Its professional services cover critical areas like architectural design and planning, system implementation, configuration, and seamless firewall migration. Educational resources, including certifications and both online and in-classroom training, are also available, alongside comprehensive support services. Palo Alto Networks distributes its security solutions both directly and through an extensive network of channel partners. Its diverse clientele primarily comprises medium to large-scale enterprises, service providers, and governmental organizations across a wide array of industries. These sectors include education, energy, financial services, healthcare, internet and media, manufacturing, the broader public sector, and telecommunications. Established in 2005, Palo Alto Networks maintains its corporate headquarters in Santa Clara, California.",
    "description_zh": "Palo Alto Networks, Inc. (PANW) 為全球領先的進階網路資安解決方案供應商。其核心產品包含硬體與軟體防火牆，以及Panorama資安管理平台，用於集中管理部署於實體、虛擬環境及公私有雲的防火牆。公司亦提供虛擬系統升級，以強化實體防火牆效能。\n\n在訂閱服務方面，PANW提供多元化的資安防護功能，涵蓋威脅預防、惡意軟體與進階持續性威脅(APT)防護、網址過濾、筆電及行動裝置資安、DNS資安、物聯網(IoT)資安、SaaS資安（透過API與內嵌機制）、威脅情資與資料外洩防護等。\n\n此外，PANW提供專業顧問與支援服務，包含雲端資安、安全存取解決方案、資安分析自動化工具，以及整合威脅情資的資安顧問服務。其專業服務亦涵蓋資安架構設計、系統實作、配置與防火牆移轉，並提供教育訓練、認證及全面的客戶支援。\n\nPANW主要透過直銷與廣泛的通路夥伴銷售其資安解決方案。客戶群遍及中大型企業、服務供應商與政府機構，涵蓋教育、能源、金融、醫療、網路媒體、製造、公共事業及電信等多樣產業。公司成立於2005年，總部設於加州聖塔克拉拉。",
