    "image": "https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/GOOGL.png",
    "logo": "https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/GOOGL.png",
    "website": "https://www.abc.xyz",
    "ceo": "Sundar Pichai",
    "full_time_employees": "198933",
    "description": "Alphabet Inc. provides a diverse range of products and digital platforms to consumers across multiple global regions, including North and South America, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, and the Asia-Pacific. The company's operations are organized into three primary divisions: Google Services, Google Cloud, and \"Other Bets.\" The Google Services segment delivers core offerings such as its advertising solutions, the Android operating system, the Chrome browser, and various hardware. It also features popular applications like Gmail, Google Drive, Google Maps, Google Photos, Google Play, Search, and YouTube. This division further handles the sale of applications, in-app purchases, and digital content via the Google Play store, alongside marketing devices such as Fitbit wearables, Google Nest smart home products, Pixel smartphones, and other proprietary hardware. It also provides non-advertising services for YouTube. The Google Cloud segment offers a comprehensive suite of infrastructure, platform, and other cloud computing services for businesses. This includes Google Workspace, a collection of cloud-native collaboration tools for enterprises, featuring applications like Gmail, Docs, Drive, Calendar, and Meet, among other specialized services for corporate clients. Lastly, the \"Other Bets\" segment is engaged in developing and selling health technology and internet services. Established in 1998, Alphabet Inc. maintains its principal executive offices in Mountain View, California.",
    "description_en": "Alphabet Inc. provides a diverse range of products and digital platforms to consumers across multiple global regions, including North and South America, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, and the Asia-Pacific. The company's operations are organized into three primary divisions: Google Services, Google Cloud, and \"Other Bets.\" The Google Services segment delivers core offerings such as its advertising solutions, the Android operating system, the Chrome browser, and various hardware. It also features popular applications like Gmail, Google Drive, Google Maps, Google Photos, Google Play, Search, and YouTube. This division further handles the sale of applications, in-app purchases, and digital content via the Google Play store, alongside marketing devices such as Fitbit wearables, Google Nest smart home products, Pixel smartphones, and other proprietary hardware. It also provides non-advertising services for YouTube. The Google Cloud segment offers a comprehensive suite of infrastructure, platform, and other cloud computing services for businesses. This includes Google Workspace, a collection of cloud-native collaboration tools for enterprises, featuring applications like Gmail, Docs, Drive, Calendar, and Meet, among other specialized services for corporate clients. Lastly, the \"Other Bets\" segment is engaged in developing and selling health technology and internet services. Established in 1998, Alphabet Inc. maintains its principal executive offices in Mountain View, California.",
    "description_zh": "美股企業 Alphabet Inc. (GOOGL) 業務遍佈全球，為消費者提供多元化的產品與數位平台。該公司營運劃分為三大核心板塊：Google 服務 (Google Services)、Google 雲端 (Google Cloud) 及其他業務 (Other Bets)。\n\nGoogle 服務部門涵蓋核心產品，如其廣告業務、Android 作業系統、Chrome 瀏覽器，以及相關硬體產品。此外，亦包括 Gmail、Google Drive、Google Maps、Google Photos、Google Play、Search 和 YouTube 等熱門應用程式。此部門透過 Google Play 商店銷售應用程式、應用程式內購與數位內容，並負責行銷 Fitbit 穿戴式裝置、Google Nest 智慧居家產品、Pixel 智慧型手機及其他專有硬體，同時提供 YouTube 的非廣告相關服務。\n\nGoogle 雲端部門則為企業客戶提供基礎設施、平台與其他雲端運算服務的全方位解決方案。這包括 Google Workspace，一套專為企業打造的雲端原生協作工具，包含 Gmail、Docs、Drive、Calendar、Meet 等生產力應用程式，並提供針對企業客戶的客製化服務。\n\n「其他業務」部門著重於發展並銷售健康科技及網路服務。Alphabet Inc. 於 1998 年成立，總部設於美國加州山景城。",
