    "description": "Netflix, Inc. serves as a worldwide entertainment provider. Its comprehensive library features television series, motion pictures, documentaries, and mobile games, spanning numerous genres and languages. Members can effortlessly stream this content through a variety of internet-connected devices, including smart TVs, digital media players, cable boxes, and mobile phones. Furthermore, the company continues to offer a DVD-by-mail subscription service to its customers in the United States. With roughly 222 million paying subscribers distributed across 190 countries, Netflix was founded in 1997 and is headquartered in Los Gatos, California.",
    "description_en": "Netflix, Inc. serves as a worldwide entertainment provider. Its comprehensive library features television series, motion pictures, documentaries, and mobile games, spanning numerous genres and languages. Members can effortlessly stream this content through a variety of internet-connected devices, including smart TVs, digital media players, cable boxes, and mobile phones. Furthermore, the company continues to offer a DVD-by-mail subscription service to its customers in the United States. With roughly 222 million paying subscribers distributed across 190 countries, Netflix was founded in 1997 and is headquartered in Los Gatos, California.",
    "description_zh": "Netflix (NFLX) 為全球領先的串流娛樂服務供應商。其內容庫涵蓋原創與授權的電視影集、電影、紀錄片及行動遊戲，內容橫跨多元類型與語言。用戶可透過訂閱模式，於各類連網裝置如智慧電視、數位媒體播放器、機上盒及行動裝置等，隨選串流觀看。此外，在美國市場仍持續提供郵寄DVD租賃服務。截至目前，Netflix在全球190多個國家擁有約2.22億付費訂戶。公司於1997年創立，總部設於加州洛斯加圖斯。",
