    "image": "https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/T.png",
    "logo": "https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/T.png",
    "website": "https://www.att.com",
    "ceo": "John T. Stankey",
    "full_time_employees": "133030",
    "description": "Globally, AT&T Inc. delivers an array of telecommunication, media, and technology offerings. Within its Communications division, the company supplies wireless voice and data communication services. It also markets mobile devices, such as smartphones, wireless data access cards, and portable computing gadgets, alongside accessories like protective cases and hands-free equipment. These products are distributed through AT&T's proprietary outlets, authorized agents, and external retail partners. Furthermore, this segment caters to a broad clientele including multinational corporations, small-to-medium-sized enterprises, government entities, and wholesale clients. For these customers, it delivers an extensive suite of services encompassing data, voice connectivity, cybersecurity, cloud-based solutions, outsourcing, and both managed and professional services, in addition to client-side equipment. Residential consumers also benefit from this division's provision of high-speed fiber optic internet and traditional landline telephone services. Its communication-related offerings and merchandise are promoted under well-known brand names such as AT&T, Cricket, AT&T PREPAID, and AT&T Fiber. The Latin America segment is responsible for delivering wireless communication services within Mexico, as well as video entertainment services across the wider Latin American region. These services and products are branded as AT&T and Unefon. Established in 1983 and headquartered in Dallas, Texas, the corporation was previously known as SBC Communications Inc. and officially adopted the name AT&T Inc. in 2005.",
    "description_en": "Globally, AT&T Inc. delivers an array of telecommunication, media, and technology offerings. Within its Communications division, the company supplies wireless voice and data communication services. It also markets mobile devices, such as smartphones, wireless data access cards, and portable computing gadgets, alongside accessories like protective cases and hands-free equipment. These products are distributed through AT&T's proprietary outlets, authorized agents, and external retail partners. Furthermore, this segment caters to a broad clientele including multinational corporations, small-to-medium-sized enterprises, government entities, and wholesale clients. For these customers, it delivers an extensive suite of services encompassing data, voice connectivity, cybersecurity, cloud-based solutions, outsourcing, and both managed and professional services, in addition to client-side equipment. Residential consumers also benefit from this division's provision of high-speed fiber optic internet and traditional landline telephone services. Its communication-related offerings and merchandise are promoted under well-known brand names such as AT&T, Cricket, AT&T PREPAID, and AT&T Fiber. The Latin America segment is responsible for delivering wireless communication services within Mexico, as well as video entertainment services across the wider Latin American region. These services and products are branded as AT&T and Unefon. Established in 1983 and headquartered in Dallas, Texas, the corporation was previously known as SBC Communications Inc. and officially adopted the name AT&T Inc. in 2005.",
    "description_zh": "AT&T Inc.（股票代碼：T）是一家全球性的電信、媒體與科技服務供應商。其核心業務主要透過「通訊事業部」與「拉丁美洲事業部」兩大板塊運營。\n\n通訊事業部專注於提供無線語音與數據通訊服務，並銷售智慧型手機、無線數據上網卡及其他行動裝置與配件（如保護殼、免持裝置）。其產品透過直營門市、授權經銷商及外部零售夥伴等多元通路進行銷售。此事業部同時服務廣泛的企業級客戶，包含跨國企業、中小型企業、政府機構及批發客戶，提供數據連線、語音通訊、網路資安、雲端解決方案、委外管理與專業諮詢等企業級服務，並供應相關客戶端設備。此外，亦為住宅用戶提供高速光纖寬頻上網與固網電話服務。此事業部旗下知名品牌包括AT&T、Cricket、AT&T PREPAID及AT&T Fiber。\n\n拉丁美洲事業部則專注於墨西哥市場的無線通訊服務，並在更廣泛的拉丁美洲區域提供影音娛樂內容服務，主要品牌為AT&T與Unefon。\n\nAT&T Inc.於1983年成立，總部設於德州達拉斯，其前身為SBC Communications Inc.，於2005年正式更名為AT&T Inc.。",
