    "full_time_employees": "4000",
    "description": "TKO Group Holdings, Inc. stands as a significant enterprise within the sports and entertainment industries. Its business activities are primarily organized into four core divisions: Media and Content, Live Events, Sponsorships, and Consumer Products Licensing. The company is responsible for creating a diverse range of content, including live spectacles, television programs, and both lengthy and concise video productions. This material is disseminated to audiences in approximately 170 countries through various channels such as traditional broadcast, subscription-based television, streaming services, and numerous digital and social media platforms. Furthermore, TKO leverages its brands through the merchandising of a wide array of goods, including video games, clothing, equipment, collectible trading cards, memorabilia, digital assets, and toys. It also facilitates sales of exclusive travel packages and event admission. A key component of its revenue generation involves securing corporate sponsorships and handling advertising sales, which covers in-venue and broadcast ad placements, integrated product advertising within content, and digital advertising impressions. TKO Group Holdings, Inc. is headquartered in New York, New York, and operates as a subsidiary of Endeavor Group Holdings, Inc.",
    "description_en": "TKO Group Holdings, Inc. stands as a significant enterprise within the sports and entertainment industries. Its business activities are primarily organized into four core divisions: Media and Content, Live Events, Sponsorships, and Consumer Products Licensing. The company is responsible for creating a diverse range of content, including live spectacles, television programs, and both lengthy and concise video productions. This material is disseminated to audiences in approximately 170 countries through various channels such as traditional broadcast, subscription-based television, streaming services, and numerous digital and social media platforms. Furthermore, TKO leverages its brands through the merchandising of a wide array of goods, including video games, clothing, equipment, collectible trading cards, memorabilia, digital assets, and toys. It also facilitates sales of exclusive travel packages and event admission. A key component of its revenue generation involves securing corporate sponsorships and handling advertising sales, which covers in-venue and broadcast ad placements, integrated product advertising within content, and digital advertising impressions. TKO Group Holdings, Inc. is headquartered in New York, New York, and operates as a subsidiary of Endeavor Group Holdings, Inc.",
    "description_zh": "TKO Group Holdings, Inc. (TKO) 為體育娛樂產業之指標性企業，其業務營運主要涵蓋四大核心板塊：媒體內容製作與發行、現場賽事與活動、贊助與廣告業務，以及消費性產品授權與銷售。該公司負責製作多元內容產品，包括現場賽事、電視節目及各類長短影音，並透過傳統廣播電視、付費訂閱電視、串流媒體服務，以及數位與社群媒體平台，將內容發行至全球約170個國家。\n\nTKO亦透過其強大品牌影響力，授權銷售各式周邊商品，範疇涵蓋電子遊戲、服飾、運動器材、收藏卡牌、紀念品、數位資產及玩具等。此外，其業務亦包含獨家旅遊套裝行程與賽事門票銷售。主要營收來源之一為企業贊助及廣告銷售，內容涵蓋場地內廣告、廣播廣告投放、內容置入式廣告，以及數位廣告曝光。TKO Group Holdings, Inc. 總部位於紐約市，是Endeavor Group Holdings, Inc. 旗下的重要子公司。",
