    "website": "https://www.lowes.com",
    "ceo": "Marvin R. Ellison",
    "full_time_employees": "276000",
    "description": "Lowe's Companies, Inc., together with its various subsidiary entities, operates as a prominent home improvement retailer serving both the United States and international markets. The company supplies a broad spectrum of items essential for construction, upkeep, renovations, and interior design projects. Its comprehensive product line encompasses major appliances, seasonal and outdoor living essentials, lawn and garden tools, timber, kitchen and bathroom fixtures, power tools, paints, custom millwork, general hardware, flooring options, plumbing components, building materials, decorative accents, lighting solutions, and electrical supplies. In addition to merchandise, Lowe's facilitates installation services through independent contractors across numerous product categories, offers extended protection plans, and provides repair services covering both warranty and post-warranty issues. The company markets its inventory, comprising both well-known national brands and proprietary private-label items, to a diverse clientele including individual homeowners, tenants, and trade professionals. As of January 28, 2022, Lowe's operated 1,971 retail locations dedicated to home improvement and hardware. Products are also accessible via its e-commerce platforms, Lowes.com and Lowesforpros.com, and through its mobile applications. Established in 1921, Lowe's Companies, Inc. maintains its headquarters in Mooresville, North Carolina.",
    "description_en": "Lowe's Companies, Inc., together with its various subsidiary entities, operates as a prominent home improvement retailer serving both the United States and international markets. The company supplies a broad spectrum of items essential for construction, upkeep, renovations, and interior design projects. Its comprehensive product line encompasses major appliances, seasonal and outdoor living essentials, lawn and garden tools, timber, kitchen and bathroom fixtures, power tools, paints, custom millwork, general hardware, flooring options, plumbing components, building materials, decorative accents, lighting solutions, and electrical supplies. In addition to merchandise, Lowe's facilitates installation services through independent contractors across numerous product categories, offers extended protection plans, and provides repair services covering both warranty and post-warranty issues. The company markets its inventory, comprising both well-known national brands and proprietary private-label items, to a diverse clientele including individual homeowners, tenants, and trade professionals. As of January 28, 2022, Lowe's operated 1,971 retail locations dedicated to home improvement and hardware. Products are also accessible via its e-commerce platforms, Lowes.com and Lowesforpros.com, and through its mobile applications. Established in 1921, Lowe's Companies, Inc. maintains its headquarters in Mooresville, North Carolina.",
    "description_zh": "Lowe's Companies, Inc. (LOW) 及其子公司為美國及國際市場首屈一指的居家修繕零售商。其主要業務為提供建築、修繕、改裝及室內設計所需之各式商品。\n\n產品線廣泛，涵蓋大型家電、季節性及戶外生活用品、園藝工具、木材建材、廚衛設備、電動工具、油漆塗料、客製化木製品、各式五金、地材、水電管件、裝飾品、照明及電氣用品等。除商品銷售外，該公司亦透過獨立承包商提供多項產品的安裝服務，並提供延長保固計畫及保修服務，涵蓋保固期內外之維修需求。\n\nLowe's 銷售知名國內品牌與自有品牌商品，客群多元，包括一般自住屋主、租賃戶及專業施工業者。其營運模式整合實體門市與數位通路。截至2022年1月28日，Lowe's 共經營1,971家居家修繕及五金零售據點。消費者亦可透過其電商平台 Lowes.com、Lowesforpros.com 及行動應用程式進行採購。",
