    "full_time_employees": "93072",
    "description": "O'Reilly Automotive, Inc., along with its subsidiary companies, functions as a leading retail and wholesale provider of automotive aftermarket products, specialized tools, supplies, and accessories across the United States. The company's comprehensive inventory includes both new and reconditioned vehicle hard parts and essential maintenance items. This expansive selection covers critical components such as alternators, batteries, brake system parts, belts, chassis and driveline components, engine parts, fuel pumps, hoses, starters, temperature control systems, and water pumps. Additionally, they supply consumables like antifreeze, appearance products, engine additives, filters, various fluids, lighting solutions, oil, and wiper blades. Their accessory range features items like floor mats, seat covers, and specific truck enhancements. Beyond just parts, O'Reilly's outlets also stock auto body paint and related materials, a wide array of automotive tools, and specialized equipment catering to professional service providers. Customers can also benefit from a suite of value-added services and programs offered in-store. These include recycling initiatives for used oil, oil filters, and batteries; complimentary installation services for batteries, wiper blades, and light bulbs; comprehensive diagnostic testing for batteries, electrical systems, and vehicle modules; retrieval of check engine light codes; a convenient loaner tool program; resurfacing services for brake drums and rotors; custom hydraulic hose fabrication; and professional-grade paint shop mixing with associated materials. O'Reilly's stores serve a diverse clientele, providing an extensive product assortment for both individual do-it-yourself (DIY) mechanics and professional auto repair facilities, covering domestic and imported automobiles, vans, and trucks. As of December 31, 2021, the company maintained a significant retail presence, operating 5,759 stores throughout the United States and an additional 25 locations in Mexico. Established in 1957, O'Reilly Automotive, Inc. is headquartered in Springfield, Missouri.",
    "description_en": "O'Reilly Automotive, Inc., along with its subsidiary companies, functions as a leading retail and wholesale provider of automotive aftermarket products, specialized tools, supplies, and accessories across the United States. The company's comprehensive inventory includes both new and reconditioned vehicle hard parts and essential maintenance items. This expansive selection covers critical components such as alternators, batteries, brake system parts, belts, chassis and driveline components, engine parts, fuel pumps, hoses, starters, temperature control systems, and water pumps. Additionally, they supply consumables like antifreeze, appearance products, engine additives, filters, various fluids, lighting solutions, oil, and wiper blades. Their accessory range features items like floor mats, seat covers, and specific truck enhancements. Beyond just parts, O'Reilly's outlets also stock auto body paint and related materials, a wide array of automotive tools, and specialized equipment catering to professional service providers. Customers can also benefit from a suite of value-added services and programs offered in-store. These include recycling initiatives for used oil, oil filters, and batteries; complimentary installation services for batteries, wiper blades, and light bulbs; comprehensive diagnostic testing for batteries, electrical systems, and vehicle modules; retrieval of check engine light codes; a convenient loaner tool program; resurfacing services for brake drums and rotors; custom hydraulic hose fabrication; and professional-grade paint shop mixing with associated materials. O'Reilly's stores serve a diverse clientele, providing an extensive product assortment for both individual do-it-yourself (DIY) mechanics and professional auto repair facilities, covering domestic and imported automobiles, vans, and trucks. As of December 31, 2021, the company maintained a significant retail presence, operating 5,759 stores throughout the United States and an additional 25 locations in Mexico. Established in 1957, O'Reilly Automotive, Inc. is headquartered in Springfield, Missouri.",
    "description_zh": "O'Reilly Automotive, Inc. (ORLY) 及其子公司，為美國領先之汽車零組件售後服務市場零售及批發供應商。其核心業務為提供各式汽車維修與保養所需之全新及翻修零組件，涵蓋發電機、電瓶、煞車系統、皮帶、底盤及傳動系統、引擎零件、燃油泵、軟管、啟動馬達、溫控系統、水泵等關鍵部件。\n\n另亦供應防凍液、車輛美容品、引擎添加劑、各式濾清器、潤滑油品、照明設備、雨刷等耗材，以及腳踏墊、座椅套及卡車專用配件等。此外，公司門市亦銷售車身噴漆材料、各類專業汽車工具及設備。\n\nORLY 不僅提供廣泛的產品線，更透過門市提供多元加值服務，強化客戶體驗，包括廢機油、機油濾清器及電瓶回收；電瓶、雨刷、燈泡免費安裝；電瓶、電氣系統及車輛模組診斷；引擎故障碼讀取；工具租借方案；煞車鼓與碟盤平面研磨；客製化液壓軟管製作；以及專業級車漆調色服務。\n\n其服務客群涵蓋廣泛，從一般自行維修（DIY）車主至專業汽車修護廠，提供適用於國產及進口汽車、廂型車、貨卡之全方位解決方案。截至2021年12月31日，ORLY在美國營運5,759家門市，並於墨西哥設有25個據點，展現其堅實的市場覆蓋率。該公司於1957年成立，總部位於密蘇里州春田市。",
