    "ceo": "Jamie J. Iannone",
    "full_time_employees": "12300",
    "description": "eBay Inc. manages an extensive global e-commerce ecosystem designed to facilitate transactions between buyers and sellers. This framework primarily encompasses its flagship website, ebay.com, alongside its suite of dedicated mobile applications. Through these digital platforms, users are empowered to list, discover, purchase, and pay for a vast array of goods. These transactions occur across a multitude of channels—online, mobile, and even certain traditional avenues—involving a diverse array of participants. This includes individual sellers, small businesses, and larger entities such as retailers, distributors, liquidators, import/export firms, and auctioneers, often integrating with various commerce platforms, search engines, and shopping networks. The company was established in 1995 and its corporate headquarters are situated in San Jose, California.",
    "description_en": "eBay Inc. manages an extensive global e-commerce ecosystem designed to facilitate transactions between buyers and sellers. This framework primarily encompasses its flagship website, ebay.com, alongside its suite of dedicated mobile applications. Through these digital platforms, users are empowered to list, discover, purchase, and pay for a vast array of goods. These transactions occur across a multitude of channels—online, mobile, and even certain traditional avenues—involving a diverse array of participants. This includes individual sellers, small businesses, and larger entities such as retailers, distributors, liquidators, import/export firms, and auctioneers, often integrating with various commerce platforms, search engines, and shopping networks. The company was established in 1995 and its corporate headquarters are situated in San Jose, California.",
    "description_zh": "eBay Inc. 是一家全球領先的電子商務平台營運商，致力於建構完善的數位生態系統，旨在高效促成買家與賣家之間的商品交易。其核心業務仰賴旗艦網站 ebay.com 及一系列專屬行動應用程式，作為主要服務介面。\n\n透過這些數位平台，使用者可便利地刊登商品、進行探索、完成購買及支付各類琳瑯滿目的貨品。這些交易不僅限於線上及行動裝置通路，亦涵蓋部分傳統渠道，匯聚了多元的參與主體，從個人賣家、中小企業，乃至大型零售商、批發商、清算業者、進出口貿易商及拍賣行等。為擴大服務範圍，eBay亦與其他電子商務平台、搜尋引擎及購物網路進行深度整合。公司成立於1995年，總部設於美國加州聖荷西。",
