    "description": "S&P Global Inc., together with its subsidiaries, provides benchmarks, data, analytics, and workflow solutions in the global capital, energy and commodity, and automotive markets. It operates through five segments: S&P Global Market Intelligence, S&P Global Ratings, S&P Global Energy, S&P Global Mobility, and S&P Dow Jones Indices. The S&P Global Market Intelligence segment provides multi-asset-class data and analytics integrated with purpose-built workflow solutions. This segment offers Data, Analytics & Insights, a desktop product suite that provides data, analytics, and third-party research for global finance and corporate professionals; research, reference data, market data, derived analytics, and valuation services; enterprise solutions, such as software and workflow solutions; and credit and risk solutions for selling Ratings' credit ratings and related data and research, analytics, and financial risk solutions. The S&P Global Ratings segment operates as an independent provider of credit ratings, research, and analytics offering investors information and independent benchmarks for their investment and financial decisions as well as access to the capital markets. The S&P Global Energy segment provides information and benchmark prices for the energy and commodity markets. The S&P Global Mobility segment offers solutions for the full automotive value chain, including vehicle manufacturers, automotive suppliers, mobility service providers, retailers, consumers, and finance and insurance companies. The S&P Dow Jones Indices segment operates as an index provider that maintains various valuation and index benchmarks for investment advisors, wealth managers, and institutional investors. It has operations in the United States, European region, Asia, and internationally. S&P Global Inc. was founded in 1860 and is headquartered in New York, New York.",
    "description_en": "S&P Global Inc., together with its subsidiaries, provides benchmarks, data, analytics, and workflow solutions in the global capital, energy and commodity, and automotive markets. It operates through five segments: S&P Global Market Intelligence, S&P Global Ratings, S&P Global Energy, S&P Global Mobility, and S&P Dow Jones Indices. The S&P Global Market Intelligence segment provides multi-asset-class data and analytics integrated with purpose-built workflow solutions. This segment offers Data, Analytics & Insights, a desktop product suite that provides data, analytics, and third-party research for global finance and corporate professionals; research, reference data, market data, derived analytics, and valuation services; enterprise solutions, such as software and workflow solutions; and credit and risk solutions for selling Ratings' credit ratings and related data and research, analytics, and financial risk solutions. The S&P Global Ratings segment operates as an independent provider of credit ratings, research, and analytics offering investors information and independent benchmarks for their investment and financial decisions as well as access to the capital markets. The S&P Global Energy segment provides information and benchmark prices for the energy and commodity markets. The S&P Global Mobility segment offers solutions for the full automotive value chain, including vehicle manufacturers, automotive suppliers, mobility service providers, retailers, consumers, and finance and insurance companies. The S&P Dow Jones Indices segment operates as an index provider that maintains various valuation and index benchmarks for investment advisors, wealth managers, and institutional investors. It has operations in the United States, European region, Asia, and internationally. S&P Global Inc. was founded in 1860 and is headquartered in New York, New York.",
    "description_zh": "標普全球公司（NASDAQ: SPGI）透過其子公司，在全球資本市場、能源與商品市場及汽車產業，提供基準、數據、分析與工作流程解決方案。其業務劃分為五大核心事業部：\n\n*   「**標普全球市場財智**」事業部，提供整合多資產類別數據、分析與客製化工作流程解決方案。其「數據、分析與洞察」桌面產品套件，為全球金融與企業專業人士提供全面性數據、分析、第三方研究、參考數據、市場情報及估值服務，並透過企業軟體與信用風險解決方案，協助客戶進行評等相關數據分析與金融風險管理。\n*   「**標普全球評級**」為獨立信用評等、研究與分析提供商，發布客觀評等資訊與獨立基準，以協助投資者做出投資決策並進入資本市場。\n*   「**標普全球能源**」則專注於能源與商品市場，提供關鍵資訊與基準價格，促進市場透明度。\n*   「**標普全球行動**」為汽車產業完整價值鏈提供整合式解決方案，服務對象涵蓋車輛製造商、供應商、移動服務業者、零售商、消費者及金融保險機構。\n*   「**標普道瓊指數**」是領先的指數提供商，為投資顧問、財富管理師與機構投資者維護多元的估值與指數基準。\n\n公司業務遍及美國、歐洲、亞洲及全球主要市場，總部設於紐約州紐約市，創立於1860年。",
