    "image": "https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/PRU.png",
    "logo": "https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/PRU.png",
    "website": "https://www.prudential.com",
    "ceo": "Andrew Sullivan",
    "full_time_employees": "36607",
    "description": "Prudential Financial, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, provides financial products and services in the United States, Japan and internationally. It operates through PGIM, Retirement Strategies, Group Insurance, Individual Life, and International Businesses segments. The PGIM segment offers investment management services and solutions related to public fixed income, public equity, real estate debt and equity, private credit and other alternatives, and multi-asset class strategies to institutional and retail clients, as well as its insurance and retirement businesses. The Retirement Strategies segment provides a range of retirement investment, and income products and services to retirement plan sponsors in the public, private, and not-for-profit sectors; group annuities and other products; international reinsurance; investment only products; and FlexGuard suite, Fixed annuities, and variable annuities, as well as develops and distributes individual variable and fixed annuity products. The Group Insurance segment offers various group life, and long-term and short-term group disability, as well as group corporate-, bank-, and trust-owned life insurance; and supplemental health solutions including accident, critical illness, and hospital indemnity. The Individual Life segment develops and distributes variable life, universal life, and term life insurance products. The International Businesses segment develops and distributes life insurance, retirement products, investment products, and certain accident and health products. The company provides its products and services to individual and institutional customers through its proprietary and third-party distribution networks, financial professionals, and trusted partnerships. Prudential Financial, Inc. was founded in 1875 and is headquartered in Newark, New Jersey.",
    "description_en": "Prudential Financial, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, provides financial products and services in the United States, Japan and internationally. It operates through PGIM, Retirement Strategies, Group Insurance, Individual Life, and International Businesses segments. The PGIM segment offers investment management services and solutions related to public fixed income, public equity, real estate debt and equity, private credit and other alternatives, and multi-asset class strategies to institutional and retail clients, as well as its insurance and retirement businesses. The Retirement Strategies segment provides a range of retirement investment, and income products and services to retirement plan sponsors in the public, private, and not-for-profit sectors; group annuities and other products; international reinsurance; investment only products; and FlexGuard suite, Fixed annuities, and variable annuities, as well as develops and distributes individual variable and fixed annuity products. The Group Insurance segment offers various group life, and long-term and short-term group disability, as well as group corporate-, bank-, and trust-owned life insurance; and supplemental health solutions including accident, critical illness, and hospital indemnity. The Individual Life segment develops and distributes variable life, universal life, and term life insurance products. The International Businesses segment develops and distributes life insurance, retirement products, investment products, and certain accident and health products. The company provides its products and services to individual and institutional customers through its proprietary and third-party distribution networks, financial professionals, and trusted partnerships. Prudential Financial, Inc. was founded in 1875 and is headquartered in Newark, New Jersey.",
    "description_zh": "「保德信金融公司 (Prudential Financial, Inc., PRU)」業務範疇涵蓋美國、日本及全球市場，為客戶提供多元金融產品與服務。其營運劃分為五大業務板塊：\n\n1.  **PGIM (保德信資產管理)**：提供機構法人、零售客戶及公司內部保險與退休金業務投資管理服務，涵蓋公開市場固定收益與股票、不動產債務與股權、私募信貸、替代資產及多重資產策略。\n2.  **退休策略 (Retirement Strategies)**：為公、私立及非營利機構之退休金計畫贊助商，提供退休投資與收益產品服務，主要產品包含團體年金、國際再保、純投資產品、FlexGuard系列，以及固定與變額年金。\n3.  **團體保險 (Group Insurance)**：提供各類團體壽險、長期/短期團體失能險，亦包含企業、銀行與信託所有之團體壽險，並延伸至意外險、重大疾病險及住院醫療險等補充醫療解決方案。\n4.  **個人壽險 (Individual Life)**：專注於變額壽險、萬能壽險及定期壽險產品的開發與銷售。\n5.  **國際業務 (International Businesses)**：主要提供壽險、退休金、投資及部分意外與健康險產品。\n\n公司藉由自有及第三方通路、金融專業人士與策略合作夥伴，服務全球個人與機構客戶。保德信金融公司創立於1875年，總部位於美國紐澤西州紐瓦克。",
