    "description": "Aon plc operates as a professional services firm in the United States, rest of the Americas, the United Kingdom, Ireland, rest of Europe, the Middle East, Africa, and the Asia Pacific. It operates through Risk Capital and Human Capital segments. The company offers commercial risk solutions comprising retail and insurance brokerage, specialty solutions, global risk consulting, captives management, and affinity programs; health solutions, such as consulting and brokerage, consumer benefits, and talent advisory services; and wealth solutions, including retirement consulting and investments. It also provides treaty and facultative reinsurance; strategy and technology group solutions; insurance-linked securities, capital raising, strategic advice, restructuring, and merger and acquisition services; and risk management products and solutions, capital market solutions, and corporate finance advisory services. In addition, the company offers strategic design advice and actuarial services; pension risk transfer and integrated pension administration; and investment advisory services on developing and maintaining investment programs across various plan types, including defined benefit plans, defined contribution plans, master trusts, and pooled employer plans for corporations, public pensions, endowments, and foundations. Aon plc was incorporated in 1979 and is headquartered in Dublin, Ireland.",
    "description_en": "Aon plc operates as a professional services firm in the United States, rest of the Americas, the United Kingdom, Ireland, rest of Europe, the Middle East, Africa, and the Asia Pacific. It operates through Risk Capital and Human Capital segments. The company offers commercial risk solutions comprising retail and insurance brokerage, specialty solutions, global risk consulting, captives management, and affinity programs; health solutions, such as consulting and brokerage, consumer benefits, and talent advisory services; and wealth solutions, including retirement consulting and investments. It also provides treaty and facultative reinsurance; strategy and technology group solutions; insurance-linked securities, capital raising, strategic advice, restructuring, and merger and acquisition services; and risk management products and solutions, capital market solutions, and corporate finance advisory services. In addition, the company offers strategic design advice and actuarial services; pension risk transfer and integrated pension administration; and investment advisory services on developing and maintaining investment programs across various plan types, including defined benefit plans, defined contribution plans, master trusts, and pooled employer plans for corporations, public pensions, endowments, and foundations. Aon plc was incorporated in 1979 and is headquartered in Dublin, Ireland.",
    "description_zh": "Aon plc 作為全球領先的專業服務公司，業務遍及美洲、歐洲、中東、非洲及亞太地區。其核心業務環繞「風險資本」(Risk Capital) 與「人力資本」(Human Capital) 兩大事業群。\n\n在「風險資本」領域，Aon 提供多元商業風險解決方案，涵蓋零售與企業保險經紀、專業解決方案、全球風險諮詢、自保公司(Captive)管理、聯盟方案，以及合約再保與臨時再保。此外，亦提供保險聯結證券(ILS)、資本市場解決方案、企業財務顧問及重組服務、併購顧問，並提供風險管理產品與策略科技顧問服務。\n\n「人力資本」方面，服務範疇則橫跨健康與財富解決方案。健康方案包含諮詢與經紀服務、員工福利規劃、以及人才諮詢；財富方案則聚焦退休金諮詢及投資管理。Aon亦提供策略設計建議、精算服務、退休金風險移轉(Pension Risk Transfer, PRT)及整合式退休金行政管理，並為企業、政府退休基金、捐贈基金等機構客戶，提供各類退休金計畫（如確定給付制、確定提撥制、集合信託等）的投資規劃與顧問服務。",
