    "description": "UnitedHealth Group Incorporated (UNH) operates as a comprehensive healthcare enterprise across the United States, structuring its diverse services into four key divisions: UnitedHealthcare, Optum Health, Optum Insight, and Optum Rx. The UnitedHealthcare segment provides a wide array of health benefit plans and consumer-focused services. These offerings cater to a broad spectrum of clients, including large national corporations, public sector employers, mid-sized and small businesses, and individual consumers. It also delivers specialized health coverage and wellness programs tailored for individuals aged 50 and older, addressing their needs for preventive and acute care, chronic disease management, and other age-specific health issues. This division further encompasses Medicaid plans, children's health insurance, dental benefits, and various hospital and clinical services. Optum Health focuses on delivering direct healthcare solutions and management services. It facilitates access to networks of specialist care providers, offers health management programs, direct care delivery, consumer engagement initiatives, and financial services. Its diverse clientele includes individuals (served directly through care systems), employers, insurance payers, and government organizations. Optum Insight specializes in providing technology, information, and consulting services to the healthcare industry. Its offerings include software and data products, advisory consulting arrangements, and outsourced managed services. Clients span hospital systems, physicians, health plans, governmental bodies, life sciences companies, and other relevant organizations. Finally, Optum Rx handles the company's pharmaceutical care services. This segment manages retail pharmacy networks, provides home prescription delivery, and offers specialty and compounding pharmacy capabilities. Leveraging its purchasing power and clinical expertise, Optum Rx also develops advanced programs related to step therapy, formulary management, medication adherence, and integrated disease and drug therapy management. UnitedHealth Group Incorporated, founded in 1977, has its corporate headquarters located in Minnetonka, Minnesota.",
    "description_en": "UnitedHealth Group Incorporated (UNH) operates as a comprehensive healthcare enterprise across the United States, structuring its diverse services into four key divisions: UnitedHealthcare, Optum Health, Optum Insight, and Optum Rx. The UnitedHealthcare segment provides a wide array of health benefit plans and consumer-focused services. These offerings cater to a broad spectrum of clients, including large national corporations, public sector employers, mid-sized and small businesses, and individual consumers. It also delivers specialized health coverage and wellness programs tailored for individuals aged 50 and older, addressing their needs for preventive and acute care, chronic disease management, and other age-specific health issues. This division further encompasses Medicaid plans, children's health insurance, dental benefits, and various hospital and clinical services. Optum Health focuses on delivering direct healthcare solutions and management services. It facilitates access to networks of specialist care providers, offers health management programs, direct care delivery, consumer engagement initiatives, and financial services. Its diverse clientele includes individuals (served directly through care systems), employers, insurance payers, and government organizations. Optum Insight specializes in providing technology, information, and consulting services to the healthcare industry. Its offerings include software and data products, advisory consulting arrangements, and outsourced managed services. Clients span hospital systems, physicians, health plans, governmental bodies, life sciences companies, and other relevant organizations. Finally, Optum Rx handles the company's pharmaceutical care services. This segment manages retail pharmacy networks, provides home prescription delivery, and offers specialty and compounding pharmacy capabilities. Leveraging its purchasing power and clinical expertise, Optum Rx also develops advanced programs related to step therapy, formulary management, medication adherence, and integrated disease and drug therapy management. UnitedHealth Group Incorporated, founded in 1977, has its corporate headquarters located in Minnetonka, Minnesota.",
    "description_zh": "美國聯合健康集團 (UNH) 是一家綜合性醫療保健事業集團，業務遍及全美，主要透過四大核心事業體運營：UnitedHealthcare、Optum Health、Optum Insight 及 Optum Rx。\n\nUnitedHealthcare 事業體提供多元的醫療福利計畫與以消費者為中心的服務，客戶涵蓋大型跨國企業、公部門雇主、中小型企業及個人客戶。其亦為50歲以上族群量身打造專業醫療保障與健康管理方案，涵蓋預防保健、急症照護、慢性病管理及高齡相關健康議題。服務範圍並擴及醫療補助計畫、兒童健康保險、牙科福利及各類醫院與臨床服務。\n\nOptum Health 專注於提供直接醫療解決方案與管理服務，促進專科醫療服務網絡可近性，並提供健康管理方案、直接照護服務、客戶參與計畫及金融服務。其客戶群包含個人（透過照護系統直接服務）、雇主、保險支付方與政府機構。\n\nOptum Insight 提供醫療產業科技、資訊與顧問服務，包括軟體與數據產品、顧問諮詢服務及委外託管服務。主要客戶為醫院系統、醫師、健康保險計畫、政府機關及生命科學企業。\n\nOptum Rx 負責藥物照護服務，管理零售藥局網絡、提供處方藥到府配送及特殊與複方藥品服務。憑藉採購實力與臨床專業知識，開發階梯式治療、處方集管理、用藥順從性及整合性疾病與藥物治療管理等進階方案。聯合健康集團成立於1977年，總部位於明尼蘇達州明尼通卡。",
