    "ceo": "Joaquin Duato",
    "full_time_employees": "141700",
    "description": "Johnson & Johnson is a holding company, which engages in the research, development, manufacture, and sale of products in the healthcare field. It operates through the Innovative Medicine and MedTech segments. The Innovative Medicine segment focuses on immunology, infectious diseases, neuroscience, oncology, cardiovascular and metabolism, and pulmonary hypertension. The MedTech segment includes a portfolio of products used in interventional solutions, orthopaedics, surgery, and vision categories. The company was founded by Robert Wood Johnson I, James Wood Johnson, and Edward Mead Johnson Sr. in 1887 and is headquartered in New Brunswick, NJ.",
    "description_en": "Johnson & Johnson is a holding company, which engages in the research, development, manufacture, and sale of products in the healthcare field. It operates through the Innovative Medicine and MedTech segments. The Innovative Medicine segment focuses on immunology, infectious diseases, neuroscience, oncology, cardiovascular and metabolism, and pulmonary hypertension. The MedTech segment includes a portfolio of products used in interventional solutions, orthopaedics, surgery, and vision categories. The company was founded by Robert Wood Johnson I, James Wood Johnson, and Edward Mead Johnson Sr. in 1887 and is headquartered in New Brunswick, NJ.",
    "description_zh": "嬌生公司 (Johnson & Johnson, JNJ) 作為一家全球性控股公司，其核心業務涵蓋醫療保健領域的產品研究、開發、製造與銷售。\n\n公司營運主要劃分為兩大事業體：\n1.  **創新醫藥 (Innovative Medicine)**：此事業體聚焦於開發與商業化創新型藥品，關鍵治療領域包括免疫學、感染性疾病、神經科學、腫瘤學、心血管及代謝疾病，以及肺動脈高壓。\n2.  **醫療科技 (MedTech)**：此事業體提供廣泛的醫療器材與解決方案，產品組合橫跨介入性治療、骨科、外科手術及視力保健等四大類別。\n\n嬌生公司於1887年創立，總部設於美國紐澤西州新布倫瑞克。",
