    "image": "https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/GILD.png",
    "logo": "https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/GILD.png",
    "website": "https://www.gilead.com",
    "ceo": "Daniel O'Day",
    "full_time_employees": "17000",
    "description": "Gilead Sciences, Inc. is a global biopharmaceutical enterprise, with operations spanning the United States, Europe, and numerous international markets. Its core mission involves discovering, developing, and commercializing innovative medications to address critical health needs. The company's extensive product portfolio encompasses treatments for a variety of severe conditions. For HIV/AIDS, it supplies key therapies such as Biktarvy, Genvoya, Descovy, Odefsey, Truvada, Complera/Eviplera, Stribild, and Atripla. In response to the 2019 coronavirus pandemic, Gilead provides Veklury, an injectable drug for intravenous administration. Its offerings for liver diseases include Epclusa, Harvoni, Vosevi, Vemlidy, and Viread. Furthermore, Gilead assists patients battling hematological disorders, various cancers, and those undergoing cell therapy, through products like Yescarta, Tecartus, Trodelvy, and Zydelig. Other specialized medicines include Letairis, an oral drug for pulmonary arterial hypertension; Ranexa, also an oral medication, for chronic angina; and AmBisome, a liposomal formulation designed to combat serious invasive fungal infections. Gilead Sciences, Inc. actively engages in collaboration agreements with a diverse range of partners to advance its therapeutic pipeline. These include Arcus Biosciences, Inc., Pionyr Immunotherapeutics Inc., Tizona Therapeutics, Inc., Tango Therapeutics, Inc., Jounce Therapeutics, Inc., Galapagos NV, Janssen Sciences Ireland Unlimited Company, Japan Tobacco, Inc., Gadeta B.V., Bristol-Myers Squibb Company, Dragonfly Therapeutics, Inc., and Merck & Co, Inc. The company was founded in 1987 and its corporate headquarters are situated in Foster City, California.",
    "description_en": "Gilead Sciences, Inc. is a global biopharmaceutical enterprise, with operations spanning the United States, Europe, and numerous international markets. Its core mission involves discovering, developing, and commercializing innovative medications to address critical health needs. The company's extensive product portfolio encompasses treatments for a variety of severe conditions. For HIV/AIDS, it supplies key therapies such as Biktarvy, Genvoya, Descovy, Odefsey, Truvada, Complera/Eviplera, Stribild, and Atripla. In response to the 2019 coronavirus pandemic, Gilead provides Veklury, an injectable drug for intravenous administration. Its offerings for liver diseases include Epclusa, Harvoni, Vosevi, Vemlidy, and Viread. Furthermore, Gilead assists patients battling hematological disorders, various cancers, and those undergoing cell therapy, through products like Yescarta, Tecartus, Trodelvy, and Zydelig. Other specialized medicines include Letairis, an oral drug for pulmonary arterial hypertension; Ranexa, also an oral medication, for chronic angina; and AmBisome, a liposomal formulation designed to combat serious invasive fungal infections. Gilead Sciences, Inc. actively engages in collaboration agreements with a diverse range of partners to advance its therapeutic pipeline. These include Arcus Biosciences, Inc., Pionyr Immunotherapeutics Inc., Tizona Therapeutics, Inc., Tango Therapeutics, Inc., Jounce Therapeutics, Inc., Galapagos NV, Janssen Sciences Ireland Unlimited Company, Japan Tobacco, Inc., Gadeta B.V., Bristol-Myers Squibb Company, Dragonfly Therapeutics, Inc., and Merck & Co, Inc. The company was founded in 1987 and its corporate headquarters are situated in Foster City, California.",
    "description_zh": "【吉立亞醫藥 (Gilead Sciences, Inc.，GILD)】為全球性生技製藥公司，業務版圖涵蓋美國、歐洲及眾多國際市場。其核心宗旨為研發、生產及行銷創新藥物，以解決全球未滿足之醫療需求。\n\n公司產品線多元，主要聚焦於重症領域。在「人類免疫缺乏病毒 (HIV)/愛滋病 (AIDS)」方面，提供如 Biktarvy、Genvoya、Descovy 等關鍵療法。應對「2019 冠狀病毒病 (COVID-19)」疫情，則供應靜脈注射藥物 Veklury (瑞德西韋)。針對「肝臟疾病」，具備 Epclusa、Harvoni 等暢銷藥物。此外，公司在「血液腫瘤」及「細胞療法」領域亦有所著墨，產品包含 Yescarta、Tecartus、Trodelvy 及 Zydelig 等。其他特色藥物尚有治療「肺動脈高壓」的口服藥 Letairis、緩解「慢性心絞痛」的 Ranexa，以及用於對抗「嚴重侵入性黴菌感染」的脂質體製劑 AmBisome。\n\n為推進其藥品研發管線，吉立亞醫藥積極與 Arcus Biosciences、Bristol-Myers Squibb 等多元合作夥伴建立策略聯盟。該公司於 1987 年創立，總部設於美國加州福斯特市。",
