    "description": "Illumina, Inc. specializes in delivering advanced genetic and genomic analysis tools, primarily through sequencing and array technologies. The company's offerings empower clients across various sectors to integrate genomic insights into both research and clinical environments, with applications spanning critical fields like life sciences, cancer diagnostics, reproductive health, agriculture, and innovative new domains. Illumina's portfolio encompasses specialized instrumentation and necessary consumables for genetic analysis, alongside comprehensive genotyping and sequencing services. They also offer instrument maintenance agreements, collaborate through development and licensing deals, and perform cancer detection tests. Its diverse clientele comprises leading genomic research facilities, universities, state-funded laboratories, medical centers, pharmaceutical and biotechnology firms, commercial molecular diagnostic providers, and businesses focused on consumer genomics. Illumina employs a two-pronged distribution strategy, selling directly to clients across North America, Europe, Latin America, and the Asia-Pacific. Additionally, it partners with life-science distributors to reach markets in Europe, the Asia-Pacific, Latin America, the Middle East, and Africa. Established in 1998, the company maintains its corporate headquarters in San Diego, California.",
    "description_en": "Illumina, Inc. specializes in delivering advanced genetic and genomic analysis tools, primarily through sequencing and array technologies. The company's offerings empower clients across various sectors to integrate genomic insights into both research and clinical environments, with applications spanning critical fields like life sciences, cancer diagnostics, reproductive health, agriculture, and innovative new domains. Illumina's portfolio encompasses specialized instrumentation and necessary consumables for genetic analysis, alongside comprehensive genotyping and sequencing services. They also offer instrument maintenance agreements, collaborate through development and licensing deals, and perform cancer detection tests. Its diverse clientele comprises leading genomic research facilities, universities, state-funded laboratories, medical centers, pharmaceutical and biotechnology firms, commercial molecular diagnostic providers, and businesses focused on consumer genomics. Illumina employs a two-pronged distribution strategy, selling directly to clients across North America, Europe, Latin America, and the Asia-Pacific. Additionally, it partners with life-science distributors to reach markets in Europe, the Asia-Pacific, Latin America, the Middle East, and Africa. Established in 1998, the company maintains its corporate headquarters in San Diego, California.",
    "description_zh": "**Illumina, Inc. (ILMN) 是一家專精於基因與基因體分析工具的領導廠商。** 其核心技術為次世代基因定序（NGS）與基因晶片陣列，提供客戶在研究與臨床應用上整合基因體洞見。應用領域廣泛，涵蓋生命科學、癌症診斷、生殖健康、農業及多個新興領域。\n\n**公司業務範疇涵蓋專業分析儀器、配套耗材、基因分型及定序服務。** 此外，亦提供儀器維護合約、推動研發合作與授權，並提供癌症檢測服務。主要客戶群包括頂尖基因體研究機構、學術單位、政府實驗室、醫療院所、製藥與生物科技公司、商業分子診斷供應商，以及消費性基因服務業者。\n\n銷售採直銷與經銷商合作的雙軌模式。北美、歐洲、拉丁美洲及亞太地區採直接銷售；而歐洲、亞太、拉丁美洲、中東及非洲市場則透過生命科學經銷夥伴拓展。公司於1998年成立，總部設於美國加州聖地牙哥。",
