    "description": "STERIS plc provides infection prevention products and services in the United States, Ireland, and internationally. The company operates through three segments: Healthcare, Applied Sterilization Technologies, and Life Sciences. It offers a range of products including cleaning chemistries, sterility assurance products, automated endoscope reprocessing systems, surgical tables, lights, and connectivity solutions. It also provides services such as equipment maintenance, instrument repair, and contract sterilization for medical device and pharmaceutical manufacturers.",
    "description_en": "STERIS plc provides infection prevention products and services in the United States, Ireland, and internationally. The company operates through three segments: Healthcare, Applied Sterilization Technologies, and Life Sciences. It offers a range of products including cleaning chemistries, sterility assurance products, automated endoscope reprocessing systems, surgical tables, lights, and connectivity solutions. It also provides services such as equipment maintenance, instrument repair, and contract sterilization for medical device and pharmaceutical manufacturers.",
    "description_zh": "STERIS plc 是一家全球領先的醫療技術公司，核心業務為提供全面的感染預防解決方案。其服務範圍廣泛，遍及美國、愛爾蘭及國際市場。\n\n公司營運劃分為三大核心事業體：\n1.  **醫療保健 (Healthcare)** 事業部：專注於醫院、診所等醫療院所，提供感染控制、手術設備及患者安全相關產品與服務。\n2.  **應用滅菌技術 (Applied Sterilization Technologies)** 事業部：為醫療器材及製藥製造商提供專業的合約滅菌服務。\n3.  **生命科學 (Life Sciences)** 事業部：致力於服務製藥、生物科技及研究機構，提供先進的滅菌與污染控制解決方案。\n\n其多元產品組合涵蓋清潔化學品、無菌保證產品、自動內視鏡再處理系統、手術檯、手術燈及互連解決方案等。此外，公司亦提供設備維護、醫療器械修復，以及為醫療器材與製藥客戶量身打造的專業委託滅菌服務。",
