    "description": "Labcorp Holdings, Inc. offers vital diagnostic laboratory services, enabling medical professionals, healthcare facilities, pharmaceutical firms, scientific investigators, and patients to make well-informed and confident choices. The company commenced operations on April 16, 2024, and its main office is situated in Burlington, NC.",
    "description_en": "Labcorp Holdings, Inc. offers vital diagnostic laboratory services, enabling medical professionals, healthcare facilities, pharmaceutical firms, scientific investigators, and patients to make well-informed and confident choices. The company commenced operations on April 16, 2024, and its main office is situated in Burlington, NC.",
    "description_zh": "Labcorp Holdings Inc. (LH) 作為全球領先的生命科學服務提供商，其核心業務橫跨兩大關鍵板塊：\n\n1.  **診斷服務 (Diagnostics)：** 透過全球實驗室網絡，提供廣泛的臨床診斷檢測，範疇涵蓋從常規檢驗至高度專業化的基因體學、病理學分析等，服務對象為醫師、醫療院所及廣大病患。\n2.  **藥物開發服務 (Drug Development)：** 則透過旗下的Covance品牌，為全球製藥及生技公司提供從臨床前研究、臨床試驗管理至數據分析等一站式藥物研發解決方案，旨在加速新藥上市時程。\n\n該公司致力於透過精準的診斷資訊與全面的研發支持，賦能醫療專業人員、研究機構及藥廠做出明智且自信的醫療與商業決策。總部設於美國北卡羅來納州伯靈頓。",
