    "ceo": "Noel R. Wallace",
    "full_time_employees": "33600",
    "description": "Operating globally, Colgate-Palmolive Company and its affiliated entities are engaged in the production and distribution of a diverse range of consumer goods. Its operations are structured into two primary divisions: Oral, Personal and Home Care, and Pet Nutrition. The Oral, Personal and Home Care division encompasses a broad array of offerings, spanning oral hygiene (e.g., toothpastes, toothbrushes, mouthwashes), personal care (e.g., bar and liquid soaps, shower gels, shampoos, conditioners, deodorants, antiperspirants, skin health items), and home care solutions (e.g., dishwashing detergents, fabric conditioners, household cleaners). These products are distributed through various channels, including traditional and online retailers, wholesalers, and distributors, under well-known brand names such as Colgate, Darlie, elmex, hello, meridol, Sorriso, Tom's of Maine, Irish Spring, Palmolive, Protex, Sanex, Softsoap, Lady Speed Stick, Speed Stick, EltaMD, Filorga, PCA SKIN, Ajax, Axion, Fabuloso, Murphy, Suavitel, Soupline, and Cuddly. Furthermore, this segment supplies specialized pharmaceutical products to dentists and other professionals in oral healthcare. Conversely, the Pet Nutrition segment focuses on providing specialized pet food. This includes everyday nutritional options marketed under the Hill's Science Diet brand, as well as therapeutic diets designed to assist in managing various health conditions in dogs and cats, sold under the Hill's Prescription Diet brand. Distribution for these pet nutrition items occurs via pet supply stores, veterinary clinics, and online retail platforms. Established in 1806, Colgate-Palmolive Company maintains its corporate headquarters in New York, New York.",
    "description_en": "Operating globally, Colgate-Palmolive Company and its affiliated entities are engaged in the production and distribution of a diverse range of consumer goods. Its operations are structured into two primary divisions: Oral, Personal and Home Care, and Pet Nutrition. The Oral, Personal and Home Care division encompasses a broad array of offerings, spanning oral hygiene (e.g., toothpastes, toothbrushes, mouthwashes), personal care (e.g., bar and liquid soaps, shower gels, shampoos, conditioners, deodorants, antiperspirants, skin health items), and home care solutions (e.g., dishwashing detergents, fabric conditioners, household cleaners). These products are distributed through various channels, including traditional and online retailers, wholesalers, and distributors, under well-known brand names such as Colgate, Darlie, elmex, hello, meridol, Sorriso, Tom's of Maine, Irish Spring, Palmolive, Protex, Sanex, Softsoap, Lady Speed Stick, Speed Stick, EltaMD, Filorga, PCA SKIN, Ajax, Axion, Fabuloso, Murphy, Suavitel, Soupline, and Cuddly. Furthermore, this segment supplies specialized pharmaceutical products to dentists and other professionals in oral healthcare. Conversely, the Pet Nutrition segment focuses on providing specialized pet food. This includes everyday nutritional options marketed under the Hill's Science Diet brand, as well as therapeutic diets designed to assist in managing various health conditions in dogs and cats, sold under the Hill's Prescription Diet brand. Distribution for these pet nutrition items occurs via pet supply stores, veterinary clinics, and online retail platforms. Established in 1806, Colgate-Palmolive Company maintains its corporate headquarters in New York, New York.",
    "description_zh": "高露潔-棕欖公司 (Colgate-Palmolive Company, CL) 為全球領先的消費性產品製造商及經銷商。其營運主要分為兩大事業部：\n\n1.  **口腔、個人及居家護理：** 涵蓋口腔衛生用品（如牙膏、牙刷、漱口水）、個人護理產品（如香皂、沐浴乳、洗髮精、護髮素、體香劑、皮膚護理品），以及居家清潔解決方案（如洗碗精、衣物柔軟精、家用清潔劑）。旗下品牌如高露潔 (Colgate)、黑人牙膏 (Darlie)、棕欖 (Palmolive)、柔膚 (Softsoap)、EltaMD (皮膚護理)、Ajax (清潔劑) 等，透過實體零售、線上平台、批發商及經銷商等多元通路銷售。該部門亦供應專業口腔醫療產品予牙醫及相關專業人士。\n\n2.  **寵物營養：** 專注於特殊寵物食品業務。旗下希爾思 (Hill's) 品牌包含日常營養的 Science Diet 系列及針對犬貓各種健康問題的處方飼料 Prescription Diet 系列。其產品主要經由寵物用品店、獸醫診所及線上零售通路銷售。\n\n高露潔-棕欖公司成立於1806年，總部位於美國紐約。",
