    "website": "https://www.mccormickcorporation.com",
    "ceo": "Brendan Foley",
    "full_time_employees": "14100",
    "description": "McCormick & Company, Incorporated is a global leader in the manufacture, marketing, and distribution of a wide array of flavorful products, including spices, seasoning mixes, and condiments, to the food industry. Its operations are divided into two primary segments: Consumer and Flavor Solutions. The Consumer segment provides an extensive range of items such as spices, herbs, seasonings, sauces, and desserts. These are sold under numerous prominent brands across various regions: McCormick, French's, Frank's RedHot, Lawry's Cholula Hot Sauce, Gourmet Garden, Club House, and OLD BAY in the Americas; Ducros, Schwartz, Kamis, Drogheria & Alimentari, and Vahiné throughout Europe, the Middle East, and Africa (EMEA); McCormick and DaQiao in China; and McCormick, Aeroplane, and Gourmet Garden in Australia. In addition, it offers specialized regional and ethnic brands like Zatarain's, Stubb's, Thai Kitchen, and Simply Asia, and also produces goods for private labels. Its customer base encompasses a broad spectrum of retailers, including grocery stores, mass merchandisers, warehouse clubs, discount and drug stores, and e-commerce platforms. Distribution to these outlets occurs both directly and indirectly via distributors and wholesale foodservice providers. The Flavor Solutions segment caters to large-scale food manufacturers and the wider foodservice industry. It supplies essential ingredients such as seasoning blends, spices, herbs, condiments, coating systems, and complex flavor formulations. These products are delivered directly to clients or through a network of distributors. Founded in 1889, the company maintains its headquarters in Hunt Valley, Maryland.",
    "description_en": "McCormick & Company, Incorporated is a global leader in the manufacture, marketing, and distribution of a wide array of flavorful products, including spices, seasoning mixes, and condiments, to the food industry. Its operations are divided into two primary segments: Consumer and Flavor Solutions. The Consumer segment provides an extensive range of items such as spices, herbs, seasonings, sauces, and desserts. These are sold under numerous prominent brands across various regions: McCormick, French's, Frank's RedHot, Lawry's Cholula Hot Sauce, Gourmet Garden, Club House, and OLD BAY in the Americas; Ducros, Schwartz, Kamis, Drogheria & Alimentari, and Vahiné throughout Europe, the Middle East, and Africa (EMEA); McCormick and DaQiao in China; and McCormick, Aeroplane, and Gourmet Garden in Australia. In addition, it offers specialized regional and ethnic brands like Zatarain's, Stubb's, Thai Kitchen, and Simply Asia, and also produces goods for private labels. Its customer base encompasses a broad spectrum of retailers, including grocery stores, mass merchandisers, warehouse clubs, discount and drug stores, and e-commerce platforms. Distribution to these outlets occurs both directly and indirectly via distributors and wholesale foodservice providers. The Flavor Solutions segment caters to large-scale food manufacturers and the wider foodservice industry. It supplies essential ingredients such as seasoning blends, spices, herbs, condiments, coating systems, and complex flavor formulations. These products are delivered directly to clients or through a network of distributors. Founded in 1889, the company maintains its headquarters in Hunt Valley, Maryland.",
    "description_zh": "McCormick & Company (MKC) 為全球領先之香料與調味品企業，專精於各式風味產品（涵蓋香料、調味粉及佐醬）之製造、行銷與通路佈建，服務全球食品產業鏈。其營運劃分為兩大核心事業部：消費事業部 (Consumer) 與風味解決方案事業部 (Flavor Solutions)。\n\n消費事業部供應多元產品線，包含香料、草本植物、調味品、醬料與甜點等。透過旗下知名品牌組合，如北美市場的 McCormick, French's, Frank's RedHot；歐非中東的 Ducros, Schwartz；中國的大橋，以及澳洲的 Aeroplane 等，並涵蓋 Zatarain's 等地域性特色品牌及自有品牌產品。其產品銷售至雜貨店、量販店、會員制賣場、折扣店、藥妝店及電商平台等各式零售通路，分銷模式包含直接銷售，以及透過經銷商與批發餐飲服務商等間接管道。\n\n風味解決方案事業部則服務大型食品製造商與廣大餐飲服務業者，提供關鍵原物料，如調味混合料、香料、草本植物、佐醬、塗層系統及複雜風味配方，採直接銷售或經銷網路進行。公司創立於1889年，總部設於馬里蘭州亨特谷。",
