    "description_en": "Target Corp. engages in the operation and ownership of general merchandise stores. It offers food and general merchandise, clothing and household goods, electronics, and toys. Its brands include A New Day, All in Motion, Art Class, Auden, AVA & VIV, Boots and Barkley, Brightroom, Bullseye's Playground, Casaluna, Cat & Jack, Cloud Island, Colsie, dealworthy, Embark, Everspring, Favorite Day, Figmint, Future Collective, Gigglescape, Good & Gather, Goodfellow & Co, Hearth & Hand with Magnolia, Heyday, Hyde & EEK! Boutique, JoyLab, Kindfull, Kona Sol, Made By Design, Market Pantry, Mondo Llama, More Than Magic, Opalhouse, Open Story, Original Use, Pillowfort, Project 62, Room Essentials, Shade & Shore, Smartly, Smith & Hawken, Sonia Kashuk, Spritz, Sun Squad, Threshold, Universal Thread, up&up, Wild Fable, Wondershop, Xhilaration, California Roots, Casa Cantina, The Collection, Headliner, Jingle & Mingle, Rosé Bae, Photograph, SunPop, and Wine Cube. The company was founded by George Draper Dayton in 1902 and is headquartered in Minneapolis, MN.",
    "description_zh": "Target Corporation (TGT) 是一家經營綜合零售連鎖店的企業，提供多元化的商品組合。其核心產品涵蓋生鮮食品、日用雜貨、服飾、家居用品、電子產品及玩具等類別。\n\n公司策略性地深耕自有品牌，藉由旗下眾多獨家品牌，如 Good & Gather、Cat & Jack 等，有效提升商品差異化，並強化顧客忠誠度。此營運模式使其能在競爭激烈的綜合零售市場中，建立獨特價值主張，並鞏固其市場地位。",
