    "ceo": "H. Lawrence Culp Jr.",
    "full_time_employees": "57000",
    "description": "Based in Evendale, Ohio, GE Aerospace is a prominent American aviation enterprise with roots tracing back to its 1878 founding by Thomas Alva Edison. The company specializes in manufacturing and supplying jet and turboprop engines, along with integrated systems, for an extensive range of aircraft, including those in commercial, military, business, and general aviation use. Its robust brand lineup features Avio Aero, Unison, GE Additive, and Dowty Propellers. GE Aerospace organizes its activities into two core segments: Commercial Engines & Services, and Defense & Propulsion Technologies. The Commercial Engines & Services division oversees the design, development, production, and maintenance of jet engines for commercial airframes, business aviation, and aeroderivative applications. Meanwhile, the Defense & Propulsion Technologies segment is dedicated to providing vital engines and critical systems for defense-related aerospace needs.",
    "description_en": "Based in Evendale, Ohio, GE Aerospace is a prominent American aviation enterprise with roots tracing back to its 1878 founding by Thomas Alva Edison. The company specializes in manufacturing and supplying jet and turboprop engines, along with integrated systems, for an extensive range of aircraft, including those in commercial, military, business, and general aviation use. Its robust brand lineup features Avio Aero, Unison, GE Additive, and Dowty Propellers. GE Aerospace organizes its activities into two core segments: Commercial Engines & Services, and Defense & Propulsion Technologies. The Commercial Engines & Services division oversees the design, development, production, and maintenance of jet engines for commercial airframes, business aviation, and aeroderivative applications. Meanwhile, the Defense & Propulsion Technologies segment is dedicated to providing vital engines and critical systems for defense-related aerospace needs.",
    "description_zh": "奇異航太 (GE Aerospace) 為全球領先的美國航太企業，主要從事噴射引擎、渦輪螺旋槳發動機與整合性系統的研發、製造及供應，產品廣泛應用於商用、軍事、公務及通用航空各型飛機。旗下品牌如 Avio Aero、Unison、GE Additive 及 Dowty Propellers。\n\n其營運劃分兩大事業體：商用引擎與服務 (Commercial Engines & Services) 及國防與推進技術 (Defense & Propulsion Technologies)。商用引擎與服務事業體負責商用飛機、公務航空及航改型噴射引擎的設計、製造與維護；國防與推進技術事業體則專為國防航太領域提供關鍵引擎與系統解決方案。",
