    "ceo": "Carol Tomé",
    "full_time_employees": "460000",
    "description": "United Parcel Service, Inc., a package delivery and logistics provider, offers transportation and delivery services. It operates through two segments, U.S. Domestic Package and International Package. The U.S. Domestic Package segment offers time-definite delivery services for express letters, documents, packages and palletized freight through air and ground services. The International Package segment provides small package operations in Europe, the Middle East and Africa, Canada and Latin America, and Asia. The company offers a range of guaranteed day- and time-definite international transportation services; day-definite services; cross-border ground package delivery; contract-only, e-commerce solutions for non-urgent, and cross-border shipments; and international service for urgent and palletized shipments. It also provides international air and ocean freight forwarding, contract logistics, customs brokerage and insurance, mail services, healthcare logistics, distribution, and post-sales services. United Parcel Service, Inc. was founded in 1907 and is headquartered in Atlanta, Georgia.",
    "description_en": "United Parcel Service, Inc., a package delivery and logistics provider, offers transportation and delivery services. It operates through two segments, U.S. Domestic Package and International Package. The U.S. Domestic Package segment offers time-definite delivery services for express letters, documents, packages and palletized freight through air and ground services. The International Package segment provides small package operations in Europe, the Middle East and Africa, Canada and Latin America, and Asia. The company offers a range of guaranteed day- and time-definite international transportation services; day-definite services; cross-border ground package delivery; contract-only, e-commerce solutions for non-urgent, and cross-border shipments; and international service for urgent and palletized shipments. It also provides international air and ocean freight forwarding, contract logistics, customs brokerage and insurance, mail services, healthcare logistics, distribution, and post-sales services. United Parcel Service, Inc. was founded in 1907 and is headquartered in Atlanta, Georgia.",
    "description_zh": "聯合包裹服務公司 (UPS) 作為全球領先的包裹遞送與綜合物流服務供應商，提供全面的運輸與遞送服務。其業務主要劃分為兩大事業部：美國國內包裹業務與國際包裹業務。\n\n美國國內包裹業務透過空運及陸運網絡，為快遞信件、文件、包裹及棧板貨物提供定時遞送服務。國際包裹業務則涵蓋歐洲、中東和非洲、加拿大和拉丁美洲以及亞洲的小型包裹運輸，並提供國際保證定日/定時運輸、跨境陸路包裹遞送，以及針對緊急與非緊急跨境電商貨物的合約制物流解決方案。\n\nUPS 的服務範疇更擴及國際空運及海運貨運承攬、合約物流、關務代理與保險、郵件服務、醫療保健物流、配銷，乃至於售後服務等多元化解決方案。",
