    "ceo": "Jerry E. Gahlhoff Jr.",
    "full_time_employees": "21946",
    "description": "Rollins, Inc. operates a network of subsidiaries that specialize in delivering pest and wildlife management solutions to a diverse clientele, encompassing both homeowners and commercial enterprises, throughout the United States and globally. For residential properties, the company offers comprehensive pest control, safeguarding homes from prevalent invaders such as rodents, insects, and other nuisance animals. Furthermore, it devises tailored pest management strategies for various business sectors, including healthcare, foodservice, and logistics. Beyond standard pest solutions, Rollins, Inc. also provides a range of termite defense options, from conventional treatments to baiting systems, alongside other complementary services. The firm serves its customers directly through its own operations as well as through its extensive franchisee network. Established in 1948, Rollins, Inc. maintains its headquarters in Atlanta, Georgia.",
    "description_en": "Rollins, Inc. operates a network of subsidiaries that specialize in delivering pest and wildlife management solutions to a diverse clientele, encompassing both homeowners and commercial enterprises, throughout the United States and globally. For residential properties, the company offers comprehensive pest control, safeguarding homes from prevalent invaders such as rodents, insects, and other nuisance animals. Furthermore, it devises tailored pest management strategies for various business sectors, including healthcare, foodservice, and logistics. Beyond standard pest solutions, Rollins, Inc. also provides a range of termite defense options, from conventional treatments to baiting systems, alongside other complementary services. The firm serves its customers directly through its own operations as well as through its extensive franchisee network. Established in 1948, Rollins, Inc. maintains its headquarters in Atlanta, Georgia.",
    "description_zh": "Rollins, Inc. (ROL) 是一家專業的害蟲與野生動物防治服務供應商，透過其廣泛的子公司網絡，為美國及全球市場提供服務。服務對象涵蓋住宅用戶與商業機構。\n\n在住宅市場，公司提供全面的害蟲防治方案，旨在保護居家環境免受囓齒類、昆蟲及其他滋擾性動物侵害。針對商業客戶，則依據不同產業特性，如醫療保健、餐飲服務與物流業，量身打造專業的蟲害管理策略。\n\n除基礎害蟲防治外，ROL亦提供多元的白蟻防治選項，從傳統化學處理到誘餌系統皆備，並輔以其他加值服務。其營運模式採直營與加盟體系並行，藉以擴大服務覆蓋範圍。該公司成立於1948年，總部位於喬治亞州亞特蘭大。",
