    "full_time_employees": "67000",
    "description": "Automatic Data Processing, Inc. (ADP) is a global provider of cloud-based solutions designed for human capital management (HCM). The company organizes its operations into two primary segments: Employer Services and Professional Employer Organization (PEO). Through its Employer Services division, ADP delivers strategic, cloud-powered platforms and comprehensive human resources (HR) outsourcing. This encompasses a wide array of services such as payroll processing, benefits administration, talent acquisition and management, general HR and workforce management, insurance, retirement planning, and regulatory compliance, often integrated into holistic HCM solutions. Conversely, the Professional Employer Organization (PEO) segment specializes in offering HR outsourcing to small and mid-sized businesses, leveraging a co-employment framework. This segment's offerings span robust benefits packages, regulatory protection and compliance, talent engagement strategies, specialized HR expertise, all-encompassing outsourcing, and even recruitment process outsourcing. Established in 1949, ADP maintains its corporate headquarters in Roseland, New Jersey.",
    "description_en": "Automatic Data Processing, Inc. (ADP) is a global provider of cloud-based solutions designed for human capital management (HCM). The company organizes its operations into two primary segments: Employer Services and Professional Employer Organization (PEO). Through its Employer Services division, ADP delivers strategic, cloud-powered platforms and comprehensive human resources (HR) outsourcing. This encompasses a wide array of services such as payroll processing, benefits administration, talent acquisition and management, general HR and workforce management, insurance, retirement planning, and regulatory compliance, often integrated into holistic HCM solutions. Conversely, the Professional Employer Organization (PEO) segment specializes in offering HR outsourcing to small and mid-sized businesses, leveraging a co-employment framework. This segment's offerings span robust benefits packages, regulatory protection and compliance, talent engagement strategies, specialized HR expertise, all-encompassing outsourcing, and even recruitment process outsourcing. Established in 1949, ADP maintains its corporate headquarters in Roseland, New Jersey.",
    "description_zh": "Automatic Data Processing, Inc. (ADP) 是一家全球領先的雲端人力資本管理 (HCM) 解決方案供應商。其業務營運主要劃分為兩大板塊：\n\n**雇主服務 (Employer Services)** 部門，提供策略性的雲端平台與全方位人力資源 (HR) 委外服務。服務範圍涵蓋廣泛，包括薪資處理、員工福利管理、招募與人才發展、綜合人力資源及勞動管理、保險服務、退休福利規劃，以及法規遵循等，旨在提供客戶一站式的整合性人力資本管理解決方案。\n\n而**專業雇主組織 (PEO)** 部門，則專注於透過「共同聘用 (Co-employment)」模式，為中小型企業 (SMEs) 提供全面性的人力資源委外服務。此服務板塊包含設計優渥的員工福利方案、確保企業的法規保障與合規性、推動人才留任策略、提供專業的人資諮詢，以及全面的勞動關係管理與招募流程委外 (RPO) 等。\n\nADP 創立於 1949 年，總部設於美國紐澤西州羅斯蘭。",
