    "website": "https://www.donaldson.com",
    "ceo": "Richard Lewis",
    "full_time_employees": "15500",
    "description": "Donaldson Company, Inc. (DCI) is a global enterprise that develops, manufactures, and distributes an extensive range of filtration systems and their corresponding replacement parts. The company's operations are strategically divided into two core business units: Engine Products and Industrial Products. The Engine Products division provides a variety of solutions, including replacement filters for both air and liquid filtration needs, comprehensive air filtration systems, and specialized liquid filtration systems designed for fuel, lubrication, and hydraulic applications. This segment also offers exhaust and emissions control technologies, alongside a suite of sensors, indicators, and monitoring systems. Its clientele primarily consists of Original Equipment Manufacturers (OEMs) within the construction, mining, agriculture, aerospace, defense, and transportation industries. Additionally, it caters to the aftermarket through independent distributors, OEM dealership networks, private label accounts, and major fleet operators. The Industrial Products segment offers a diverse portfolio of filtration solutions, such as systems for collecting dust, fumes, and mist, as well as purification systems for compressed air. It also supplies gas and liquid filtration technologies for the food, beverage, and broader industrial sectors. Furthermore, this division manufactures air filtration systems for gas turbines, produces polytetrafluoroethylene (PTFE) membrane-based products, and designs specialized air and gas filtration systems for highly sensitive applications like hard disk drives and semiconductor manufacturing, complete with associated sensors, indicators, and monitoring systems. This segment's products are sold to a wide network of dealers and distributors, OEMs of gas-fired turbines, and various other OEMs and end-users seeking advanced air filtration solutions and replacement components. Established in 1915, Donaldson Company, Inc. maintains its corporate headquarters in Bloomington, Minnesota.",
    "description_en": "Donaldson Company, Inc. (DCI) is a global enterprise that develops, manufactures, and distributes an extensive range of filtration systems and their corresponding replacement parts. The company's operations are strategically divided into two core business units: Engine Products and Industrial Products. The Engine Products division provides a variety of solutions, including replacement filters for both air and liquid filtration needs, comprehensive air filtration systems, and specialized liquid filtration systems designed for fuel, lubrication, and hydraulic applications. This segment also offers exhaust and emissions control technologies, alongside a suite of sensors, indicators, and monitoring systems. Its clientele primarily consists of Original Equipment Manufacturers (OEMs) within the construction, mining, agriculture, aerospace, defense, and transportation industries. Additionally, it caters to the aftermarket through independent distributors, OEM dealership networks, private label accounts, and major fleet operators. The Industrial Products segment offers a diverse portfolio of filtration solutions, such as systems for collecting dust, fumes, and mist, as well as purification systems for compressed air. It also supplies gas and liquid filtration technologies for the food, beverage, and broader industrial sectors. Furthermore, this division manufactures air filtration systems for gas turbines, produces polytetrafluoroethylene (PTFE) membrane-based products, and designs specialized air and gas filtration systems for highly sensitive applications like hard disk drives and semiconductor manufacturing, complete with associated sensors, indicators, and monitoring systems. This segment's products are sold to a wide network of dealers and distributors, OEMs of gas-fired turbines, and various other OEMs and end-users seeking advanced air filtration solutions and replacement components. Established in 1915, Donaldson Company, Inc. maintains its corporate headquarters in Bloomington, Minnesota.",
    "description_zh": "Donaldson 公司 (DCI) 是一家全球領先的濾清系統製造商，專精於研發、製造與銷售多元濾清解決方案及其替換零件。其業務核心分為兩大事業部：\n\n**引擎產品事業部**：提供空氣與液體濾清替換濾心、全面的空氣濾清系統，以及專用於燃油、潤滑、液壓系統的液體濾清方案。此事業部亦涵蓋廢氣排放與汙染控制技術，並整合感測及監測系統。主要客戶為營建、採礦、農業、航太、國防及運輸等產業的原廠設備製造商 (OEMs)，同時透過獨立經銷商、原廠通路及主要車隊業者服務售後市場。\n\n**工業產品事業部**：供應集塵、煙霧、油霧過濾系統、壓縮空氣淨化系統，以及食品、飲料及廣泛工業領域的氣體與液體濾清技術。此處亦生產燃氣渦輪機專用空氣濾清系統、聚四氟乙烯 (PTFE) 薄膜產品，並為硬碟驅動器、半導體製造等高敏感應用設計專業空氣及氣體濾清系統，同樣配備感測與監測功能。產品主要銷售予代理商、經銷商、燃氣渦輪機 OEMs 及其他尋求先進濾清方案的 OEMs 與終端客戶。\n\nDCI 成立於 1915 年，總部位於明尼蘇達州布盧明頓。",
