    "ceo": "Tracy A. Robinson",
    "full_time_employees": "23839",
    "description": "Canadian National Railway Company (CNI), together with its subsidiary operations, functions as a key player in the railway and related logistics industry. The firm handles a wide array of freight, including petroleum products and chemicals, agricultural commodities such as grain and fertilizers, various minerals like coal and metals, timber and paper goods, intermodal containers, and finished automobiles. Its services cater to a broad base of clients, from international exporters and importers to retail chains, agricultural growers, and industrial manufacturers. CNI boasts a substantial rail infrastructure, with approximately 19,500 miles of track extending across both Canada and the United States. Additionally, the company provides diverse ancillary services, encompassing marine terminal management (vessels and docks), cargo transshipment and distribution, specialized automotive supply chain solutions, and comprehensive freight management and forwarding. Founded in 1919, Canadian National Railway Company is based in Montreal, Canada.",
    "description_en": "Canadian National Railway Company (CNI), together with its subsidiary operations, functions as a key player in the railway and related logistics industry. The firm handles a wide array of freight, including petroleum products and chemicals, agricultural commodities such as grain and fertilizers, various minerals like coal and metals, timber and paper goods, intermodal containers, and finished automobiles. Its services cater to a broad base of clients, from international exporters and importers to retail chains, agricultural growers, and industrial manufacturers. CNI boasts a substantial rail infrastructure, with approximately 19,500 miles of track extending across both Canada and the United States. Additionally, the company provides diverse ancillary services, encompassing marine terminal management (vessels and docks), cargo transshipment and distribution, specialized automotive supply chain solutions, and comprehensive freight management and forwarding. Founded in 1919, Canadian National Railway Company is based in Montreal, Canada.",
    "description_zh": "加拿大國家鐵路公司 (CNI) 及其子公司為北美鐵路運輸與相關物流產業的主要經營者。該公司業務承載各式貨物，包括石油產品、化學品、農牧原物料（如穀物、肥料）、礦產資源（諸如煤炭、金屬）、木材、紙漿產品、複合聯運貨櫃及成車。其客戶群體多元，包含國際進出口商、零售通路、農產業者與工業製造商。\n\nCNI 擁有約 19,500 英里、橫跨加拿大與美國的綿密鐵路網絡。此外，公司亦提供多元加值服務，涵蓋海運碼頭管理（含船舶停泊與貨物裝卸）、貨物轉運、倉儲與配送、汽車產業專業供應鏈方案，以及全方位貨運承攬與管理服務。加拿大國家鐵路公司創立於 1919 年，總部位於加拿大蒙特婁。",
