    "full_time_employees": "9600",
    "description": "ConocoPhillips is an energy company that engages in the global exploration, production, transportation, and marketing of various resources, including crude petroleum, bitumen, natural gas, liquefied natural gas (LNG), and natural gas liquids (NGLs). Its primary operations are centered on both conventional and tight oil formations, shale gas, heavy crude, LNG developments, and oil sands projects. The company's extensive portfolio includes unconventional resources located in North America; established conventional assets spanning North America, Europe, Asia, and Australia; numerous LNG ventures; oil sands properties within Canada; and a significant inventory of potential conventional and unconventional exploration opportunities. ConocoPhillips was established in 1917 and its corporate headquarters are situated in Houston, Texas.",
    "description_en": "ConocoPhillips is an energy company that engages in the global exploration, production, transportation, and marketing of various resources, including crude petroleum, bitumen, natural gas, liquefied natural gas (LNG), and natural gas liquids (NGLs). Its primary operations are centered on both conventional and tight oil formations, shale gas, heavy crude, LNG developments, and oil sands projects. The company's extensive portfolio includes unconventional resources located in North America; established conventional assets spanning North America, Europe, Asia, and Australia; numerous LNG ventures; oil sands properties within Canada; and a significant inventory of potential conventional and unconventional exploration opportunities. ConocoPhillips was established in 1917 and its corporate headquarters are situated in Houston, Texas.",
    "description_zh": "康菲石油 (ConocoPhillips, COP) 是一家全球性能源企業，其核心業務涵蓋全球上游油氣的探勘、開發、生產，並涉及相關的運輸與銷售。該公司主要產品包括原油、瀝青、天然氣、液化天然氣 (LNG) 及天然氣凝析液 (NGLs)。\n\n康菲石油的核心營運聚焦於常規與緻密油氣層、頁岩氣、重質原油、液化天然氣 (LNG) 開發案及油砂專案。其多元資產組合包含北美地區的非常規資源、遍布北美、歐洲、亞洲及澳洲的成熟常規油氣田、多個液化天然氣 (LNG) 開發專案、加拿大境內的油砂資產，以及可觀的常規與非常規潛在探勘機會。",
