    "description": "EOG Resources, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, explores for, develops, produces, and markets crude oil, natural gas liquids, and natural gas in producing basins in the United States, the Republic of Trinidad and Tobago, and internationally. The company also offers crude oil and condensate, and gathering, processing and marketing. The company was formerly known as Enron Oil & Gas Company. EOG Resources, Inc. was incorporated in 1985 and is headquartered in Houston, Texas.",
    "description_en": "EOG Resources, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, explores for, develops, produces, and markets crude oil, natural gas liquids, and natural gas in producing basins in the United States, the Republic of Trinidad and Tobago, and internationally. The company also offers crude oil and condensate, and gathering, processing and marketing. The company was formerly known as Enron Oil & Gas Company. EOG Resources, Inc. was incorporated in 1985 and is headquartered in Houston, Texas.",
    "description_zh": "EOG Resources, Inc. (NYSE: EOG) 為一家專注於油氣資源的獨立探勘與生產公司。其核心業務涵蓋原油、天然氣凝析液 (NGLs) 及天然氣的「探勘、開發、生產與銷售」全方位整合價值鏈。\n\n公司策略性地將探勘與生產活動集中於美國境內多個具有高成長潛力的核心油氣盆地，並同時拓展至千里達及托巴哥共和國及其他特定國際市場，以確保多元化且具競爭力的生產組合。EOG透過其垂直整合的營運模式，不僅致力於上游油氣資產的技術創新與優化，持續提升鑽探效率與回收率，亦提供原油與凝析油的集輸、處理及市場行銷服務。此舉旨在有效管理其從井口至終端市場的供應鏈，最大化其產出物的經濟價值，並確保穩定的產品供應，鞏固其在能源市場的領導地位。",
