    "website": "https://www.marathonpetroleum.com",
    "ceo": "Maryann T. Mannen",
    "full_time_employees": "18500",
    "description": "Marathon Petroleum Corporation (MPC) functions as a prominent integrated energy enterprise, primarily concentrating its downstream operations across the United States. Its business is bifurcated into two main divisions: Refining & Marketing, and Midstream. The Refining & Marketing segment is responsible for processing crude oil and various other raw materials at its refineries, strategically located in the U.S. Gulf Coast, Mid-Continent, and West Coast regions. This division also acquires refined petroleum products and ethanol for subsequent distribution. Key outputs from this segment encompass a diverse array of transportation fuels, including different gasoline blends, heavy fuel oil, and asphalt. Additionally, it manufactures chemicals such as aromatics, propane, propylene, and sulfur. MPC sells these refined goods through multiple channels, including wholesale marketers domestically and globally, purchasers on the open spot market, and independent entrepreneurs who manage primarily Marathon-branded retail locations. It also supplies fuel via long-term agreements to direct dealer sites, predominantly under the ARCO brand. The Midstream segment handles the comprehensive movement, storage, distribution, and commercialization of crude oil and refined products. This is achieved through its extensive network of refining logistics assets, pipelines, terminals, towboats, and barges. Moreover, this segment engages in the collection, processing, and transportation of natural gas, alongside the gathering, transport, fractionation, storage, and marketing of natural gas liquids. By December 31, 2021, the corporation supported 7,159 branded jobber retail points, managed by independent entrepreneurs, spanning 37 U.S. states, the District of Columbia, and Mexico. Marathon Petroleum Corporation, established in 1887, maintains its corporate headquarters in Findlay, Ohio.",
    "description_en": "Marathon Petroleum Corporation (MPC) functions as a prominent integrated energy enterprise, primarily concentrating its downstream operations across the United States. Its business is bifurcated into two main divisions: Refining & Marketing, and Midstream. The Refining & Marketing segment is responsible for processing crude oil and various other raw materials at its refineries, strategically located in the U.S. Gulf Coast, Mid-Continent, and West Coast regions. This division also acquires refined petroleum products and ethanol for subsequent distribution. Key outputs from this segment encompass a diverse array of transportation fuels, including different gasoline blends, heavy fuel oil, and asphalt. Additionally, it manufactures chemicals such as aromatics, propane, propylene, and sulfur. MPC sells these refined goods through multiple channels, including wholesale marketers domestically and globally, purchasers on the open spot market, and independent entrepreneurs who manage primarily Marathon-branded retail locations. It also supplies fuel via long-term agreements to direct dealer sites, predominantly under the ARCO brand. The Midstream segment handles the comprehensive movement, storage, distribution, and commercialization of crude oil and refined products. This is achieved through its extensive network of refining logistics assets, pipelines, terminals, towboats, and barges. Moreover, this segment engages in the collection, processing, and transportation of natural gas, alongside the gathering, transport, fractionation, storage, and marketing of natural gas liquids. By December 31, 2021, the corporation supported 7,159 branded jobber retail points, managed by independent entrepreneurs, spanning 37 U.S. states, the District of Columbia, and Mexico. Marathon Petroleum Corporation, established in 1887, maintains its corporate headquarters in Findlay, Ohio.",
    "description_zh": "Marathon Petroleum Corporation (MPC) 作為一家領先的綜合性能源公司，核心業務聚焦於美國下游市場。其業務範疇主要分為「煉油與行銷」及「中游」兩大板塊。\n\n「煉油與行銷」業務涵蓋於美國墨西哥灣沿岸、中大陸及西岸等策略性區位的煉油廠，進行原油及各類原料的煉製，並採購成品油與乙醇進行通路分銷。核心產品線涵蓋多元運輸燃料，例如各式汽油、重油與瀝青，亦產製芳香烴、丙烷、丙烯及硫磺等石化產品。銷售通路則包含國內外批發商、現貨市場買家，以及營運Marathon品牌零售據點的獨立經銷商；同時透過長期合約，向ARCO品牌為主的直營經銷站供油。\n\n「中游」業務負責原油與成品油的全面運輸、儲存、配送與交易，透過其廣泛的煉油物流資產、管線、油品儲運設施、拖船及駁船網絡來達成。此外，該板塊亦從事天然氣的採集、處理、運輸，以及天然氣凝析液(NGLs)的採集、運輸、分餾、儲存與銷售。截至2021年底，MPC共支持7,159個由獨立經銷商營運的品牌零售據點，遍布美國37州、華盛頓特區及墨西哥。",
