    "description": "Occidental Petroleum Corporation, together with its subsidiaries, engages in the acquisition, exploration, and development of oil and gas properties in the United States and internationally. It operates through Oil and Gas and Midstream and Marketing. The Oil and Gas segment explores for, develops, and produces oil and condensate, natural gas liquids (NGLs), and natural gas. This segment also optimizes its transportation and storage capacity and invests in entities. The Midstream and Marketing segment purchases, markets, gathers, processes, transports and stores oil, condensate, NGLs, natural gas, carbon dioxide, and power. Occidental Petroleum Corporation was founded in 1920 and is headquartered in Houston, Texas.",
    "description_en": "Occidental Petroleum Corporation, together with its subsidiaries, engages in the acquisition, exploration, and development of oil and gas properties in the United States and internationally. It operates through Oil and Gas and Midstream and Marketing. The Oil and Gas segment explores for, develops, and produces oil and condensate, natural gas liquids (NGLs), and natural gas. This segment also optimizes its transportation and storage capacity and invests in entities. The Midstream and Marketing segment purchases, markets, gathers, processes, transports and stores oil, condensate, NGLs, natural gas, carbon dioxide, and power. Occidental Petroleum Corporation was founded in 1920 and is headquartered in Houston, Texas.",
    "description_zh": "西方石油公司 (Occidental Petroleum Corporation, OXY) 是一家全球性能源公司，主要從事油氣資產的收購、探勘與開發。其營運分為兩大核心部門：\n\n1.  **油氣部門 (Oil and Gas)**：負責原油、凝析油、天然氣凝析液 (NGLs) 及天然氣的探勘、開發與生產，並優化相關運輸與儲存設施。\n2.  **中游與行銷部門 (Midstream and Marketing)**：涵蓋原油、凝析油、天然氣凝析液、天然氣、二氧化碳及電力的採購、行銷、集輸、處理、運輸與儲存業務。",
