    "image": "https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/LIN.png",
    "logo": "https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/LIN.png",
    "website": "https://www.linde.com",
    "ceo": "Sanjiv Lamba",
    "full_time_employees": "64649",
    "description": "Linde plc functions as a global industrial gas and engineering powerhouse, extending its operations throughout North and South America, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, and the Asia Pacific. The company's comprehensive product line features atmospheric gases like oxygen, nitrogen, argon, and various rare gases, alongside a diverse array of process gases such as carbon dioxide, helium, hydrogen, specialized electronic gases, and acetylene. Beyond gas supply, Linde is also adept at designing and constructing turnkey process plants. These engineering solutions serve both third-party customers and its own gas business facilities, covering types like olefin, natural gas, air separation, hydrogen, and synthesis gas plants. Linde's extensive client base spans numerous sectors, including healthcare, energy, general manufacturing, food and beverage carbonation, fiber-optics, steel production, aerospace, chemicals, and water treatment. Established in 1879, the company is headquartered in Woking, United Kingdom.",
    "description_en": "Linde plc functions as a global industrial gas and engineering powerhouse, extending its operations throughout North and South America, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, and the Asia Pacific. The company's comprehensive product line features atmospheric gases like oxygen, nitrogen, argon, and various rare gases, alongside a diverse array of process gases such as carbon dioxide, helium, hydrogen, specialized electronic gases, and acetylene. Beyond gas supply, Linde is also adept at designing and constructing turnkey process plants. These engineering solutions serve both third-party customers and its own gas business facilities, covering types like olefin, natural gas, air separation, hydrogen, and synthesis gas plants. Linde's extensive client base spans numerous sectors, including healthcare, energy, general manufacturing, food and beverage carbonation, fiber-optics, steel production, aerospace, chemicals, and water treatment. Established in 1879, the company is headquartered in Woking, United Kingdom.",
    "description_zh": "Linde plc (LIN) 為全球領先的工業氣體與工程技術整合服務供應商，營運版圖廣佈美洲、歐非中東及亞太地區。其核心產品線包含氧、氮、氬等空氣分離氣體，以及二氧化碳、氦、氫、電子級特殊氣體及乙炔等製程氣體。公司亦提供統包工程解決方案，為第三方客戶及自有氣體生產設施設計建造烯烴、天然氣、空氣分離、氫氣與合成氣等多元製程廠。其廣泛客戶群涵蓋醫療照護、能源、一般製造、食品飲料碳酸化、光纖、鋼鐵、航太、化學及水處理等關鍵產業。",
