    "website": "https://www.ecolab.com",
    "ceo": "Christophe Beck",
    "full_time_employees": "48000",
    "description": "Ecolab Inc. provides water, hygiene, and infection prevention solutions and services in the United States and internationally. The company operates through four segments: Global Water, Global Institutional & Specialty, Global Pest Elimination, and Global Life Sciences. The Global Water segment offers water treatment and process applications, and cleaning and sanitizing solutions to manufacturing, food and beverage processing, transportation, chemical, primary metals and mining, power generation, global refining, petrochemical, pulp and paper industries. The Global Institutional & Specialty segment provides cleaning and sanitizing products to the foodservice, healthcare, hospitality, lodging, government, education and retail industries. The Global Pest Elimination segment provides pest elimination services to detect, prevent, and eliminate pests comprising rodents and insects in full-service and quick-service restaurants, food and beverage processors, hotels, grocery operations, and other commercial segments, including education, life sciences, and healthcare. The Global Life Sciences segment provides cleaning and contamination control solutions to pharmaceutical and personal care manufacturers. It offers its products under the Ecolab, Kay, Purolite, and Bioquell brand names. The company sells its products through field sales and corporate account personnel, distributors, and dealers. Ecolab Inc. was founded in 1923 and is headquartered in Saint Paul, Minnesota.",
    "description_en": "Ecolab Inc. provides water, hygiene, and infection prevention solutions and services in the United States and internationally. The company operates through four segments: Global Water, Global Institutional & Specialty, Global Pest Elimination, and Global Life Sciences. The Global Water segment offers water treatment and process applications, and cleaning and sanitizing solutions to manufacturing, food and beverage processing, transportation, chemical, primary metals and mining, power generation, global refining, petrochemical, pulp and paper industries. The Global Institutional & Specialty segment provides cleaning and sanitizing products to the foodservice, healthcare, hospitality, lodging, government, education and retail industries. The Global Pest Elimination segment provides pest elimination services to detect, prevent, and eliminate pests comprising rodents and insects in full-service and quick-service restaurants, food and beverage processors, hotels, grocery operations, and other commercial segments, including education, life sciences, and healthcare. The Global Life Sciences segment provides cleaning and contamination control solutions to pharmaceutical and personal care manufacturers. It offers its products under the Ecolab, Kay, Purolite, and Bioquell brand names. The company sells its products through field sales and corporate account personnel, distributors, and dealers. Ecolab Inc. was founded in 1923 and is headquartered in Saint Paul, Minnesota.",
    "description_zh": "Ecolab Inc. (ECL) 是一家全球領先的水、衛生及感染預防解決方案與服務供應商，業務遍及美國及全球市場。其營運主要分為四大事業部：\n\n1.  **全球水處理事業部 (Global Water)**：提供水處理、製程應用，以及清潔與消毒解決方案，服務範圍涵蓋製造業、食品飲料加工、運輸、化工、基礎金屬與採礦、發電、全球煉油、石化及紙漿造紙等產業。\n2.  **全球機構與專業服務事業部 (Global Institutional & Specialty)**：專為餐飲服務、醫療保健、酒店、住宿、政府機關、教育機構及零售業提供清潔與消毒產品。\n3.  **全球病蟲害防治事業部 (Global Pest Elimination)**：提供害蟲偵測、預防與清除服務，主要處理齧齒動物與昆蟲問題。服務對象包括全方位與快速服務餐廳、食品飲料加工業者、酒店、生鮮超市，以及教育、生命科學與醫療保健等商業領域。\n4.  **全球生命科學事業部 (Global Life Sciences)**：聚焦於製藥及個人護理品製造商，提供清潔及污染控制解決方案。\n\n公司旗下知名品牌包含 Ecolab、Kay、Purolite 及 Bioquell。其產品主要透過銷售人員、企業客戶專員、經銷商及代理商等多元通路進行銷售。Ecolab 總部位於明尼蘇達州聖保羅，於 1923 年成立。",
