    "image": "https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/CTVA.png",
    "logo": "https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/CTVA.png",
    "website": "https://www.corteva.com",
    "ceo": "Luke C. Kissam",
    "full_time_employees": "21500",
    "description": "Corteva, Inc. operates in the agriculture business. The company operates through two segments, Seed and Crop Protection. The Seed segment develops and supplies advanced germplasm and traits that produce optimum yield for farms. It offers trait technologies that enhance resistance to weather, disease, insects, and herbicides used to control weeds, as well as food and nutritional characteristics. This segment also provides digital solutions that assist farmer decision-making with a view to optimize product selection, and maximize yield and profitability. The Crop Protection segment offers products that protect against weeds, insects and other pests, and diseases, as well as enhances crop health above and below ground through nitrogen management and seed-applied technologies. This segment provides herbicides, insecticides, nitrogen stabilizers, and pasture and range management herbicides. It serves agricultural input industry. The company operates in the United States, Canada, Latin America, the Asia Pacific, Europe, the Middle East, and Africa. Corteva, Inc. was founded in 1802 and is headquartered in Indianapolis, Indiana.",
    "description_en": "Corteva, Inc. operates in the agriculture business. The company operates through two segments, Seed and Crop Protection. The Seed segment develops and supplies advanced germplasm and traits that produce optimum yield for farms. It offers trait technologies that enhance resistance to weather, disease, insects, and herbicides used to control weeds, as well as food and nutritional characteristics. This segment also provides digital solutions that assist farmer decision-making with a view to optimize product selection, and maximize yield and profitability. The Crop Protection segment offers products that protect against weeds, insects and other pests, and diseases, as well as enhances crop health above and below ground through nitrogen management and seed-applied technologies. This segment provides herbicides, insecticides, nitrogen stabilizers, and pasture and range management herbicides. It serves agricultural input industry. The company operates in the United States, Canada, Latin America, the Asia Pacific, Europe, the Middle East, and Africa. Corteva, Inc. was founded in 1802 and is headquartered in Indianapolis, Indiana.",
    "description_zh": "Corteva, Inc. 是一家農業公司，經營**種子**與**作物保護**兩大事業部。\n\n種子事業部開發供應先進種原及生物性狀技術，以優化產能，提升作物對氣候逆境、病蟲害、除草劑之耐受性與營養價值。並提供數位方案，輔助農民選用決策，以最大化產量及收益。\n\n作物保護事業部提供雜草、蟲害、病害防治產品組合。透過氮肥管理及種子處理技術，強化作物地上地下健康。產品線涵蓋除草劑、殺蟲劑、氮肥穩定劑及牧草地除草劑。\n\nCorteva服務全球農業投入產業，業務遍及北美、拉丁美洲、亞太、歐洲、中東與非洲。",
