    "ceo": "Joseph Dominguez",
    "full_time_employees": "15315",
    "description": "Constellation Energy Corporation operates as a U.S.-based firm dedicated to producing and distributing electricity. Its activities are organized across five primary geographical segments: the Mid-Atlantic, Midwest, New York, ERCOT, and various other power markets. In addition to electrical power, the company supplies natural gas, sustainable energy solutions, and an array of associated energy products and services. Possessing a significant generation capability of 32,400 megawatts, its power portfolio incorporates diverse sources such as nuclear, wind, solar, natural gas, and hydroelectric facilities. The company serves a wide spectrum of clients, including utility distributors, local government bodies, cooperatives, along with commercial, industrial, public sector, and household consumers. Founded in 2021, its corporate headquarters are situated in Baltimore, Maryland. Constellation Energy Corporation previously operated as a subsidiary of Exelon Corporation.",
    "description_en": "Constellation Energy Corporation operates as a U.S.-based firm dedicated to producing and distributing electricity. Its activities are organized across five primary geographical segments: the Mid-Atlantic, Midwest, New York, ERCOT, and various other power markets. In addition to electrical power, the company supplies natural gas, sustainable energy solutions, and an array of associated energy products and services. Possessing a significant generation capability of 32,400 megawatts, its power portfolio incorporates diverse sources such as nuclear, wind, solar, natural gas, and hydroelectric facilities. The company serves a wide spectrum of clients, including utility distributors, local government bodies, cooperatives, along with commercial, industrial, public sector, and household consumers. Founded in 2021, its corporate headquarters are situated in Baltimore, Maryland. Constellation Energy Corporation previously operated as a subsidiary of Exelon Corporation.",
    "description_zh": "Constellation Energy Corporation (CEG) 是一家總部位於美國的能源企業，核心業務為電力生產與配銷。其營運範圍主要佈局於五大核心地理區域市場：中大西洋、中西部、紐約、ERCOT 及其他電力市場。除電力業務外，CEG 亦提供天然氣、永續能源解決方案，以及多元化的能源相關產品與服務。\n\n該公司具備高達 32,400 百萬瓦 (MW) 的總發電量能，其發電組合高度多元化，涵蓋核能、風力、太陽能、天然氣及水力等複合式發電設施。CEG 的客戶群涵蓋廣泛，包括公用事業配電商、地方政府機關、合作社，以及商業、工業、公共事業與民生用戶。\n\n該公司成立於 2021 年，總部設於馬里蘭州巴爾的摩。值得注意的是，CEG 前身為 Exelon Corporation 的子公司，後經分拆獨立運作。",
