    "full_time_employees": "17581",
    "description": "American Electric Power Company, Inc. (AEP) operates as a prominent electric utility holding company, with its core business encompassing the generation, transmission, and delivery of electricity. Serving both retail and wholesale clients across the United States, AEP organizes its extensive operations into several key segments: Vertically Integrated Utilities, Transmission and Distribution Utilities, AEP Transmission Holdco, and Generation & Marketing. The firm produces its electrical power from a diverse portfolio of energy sources, including coal, lignite, natural gas, nuclear, hydroelectric, solar, and wind power, alongside other emerging technologies. Beyond direct consumer sales, AEP also functions as a major wholesale electricity supplier, providing power to other utility companies, rural electric cooperatives, municipalities, and various other participants within the energy market. Incorporated in 1906, the company's corporate headquarters are situated in Columbus, Ohio.",
    "description_en": "American Electric Power Company, Inc. (AEP) operates as a prominent electric utility holding company, with its core business encompassing the generation, transmission, and delivery of electricity. Serving both retail and wholesale clients across the United States, AEP organizes its extensive operations into several key segments: Vertically Integrated Utilities, Transmission and Distribution Utilities, AEP Transmission Holdco, and Generation & Marketing. The firm produces its electrical power from a diverse portfolio of energy sources, including coal, lignite, natural gas, nuclear, hydroelectric, solar, and wind power, alongside other emerging technologies. Beyond direct consumer sales, AEP also functions as a major wholesale electricity supplier, providing power to other utility companies, rural electric cooperatives, municipalities, and various other participants within the energy market. Incorporated in 1906, the company's corporate headquarters are situated in Columbus, Ohio.",
    "description_zh": "美國電力公司 (American Electric Power Company, Inc., AEP) 是一家領先的電力公用事業控股公司，核心業務涵蓋電力之「發、輸、配」一體化服務，主要服務美國境內之零售與批發客戶。其營運主要區分為：垂直整合型公用事業、輸配電型公用事業、AEP輸電控股事業，以及發電與行銷等部門。\n\n該公司發電來源多元，涵蓋燃煤、褐煤、天然氣、核能、水力、太陽能、風力等傳統與再生能源，並持續整合新興能源技術。除直接售電予終端用戶外，AEP亦為主要批發電力供應商，供電予其他電力公司、鄉村電力合作社、市政機關及其他能源市場參與者。公司總部設於俄亥俄州哥倫布市。",
