    "ceo": "Daniel S. Letter",
    "full_time_employees": "2802",
    "description": "Prologis, Inc. don't just lead the industry, they define it. The firm creates the intelligent infrastructure that powers global commerce, seamlessly connecting the digital and physical worlds. From agile supply chains to clean energy solutions, their ecosystems help your business move faster, operate smarter and grow sustainably. With unmatched scale, innovation and expertise, Prologis is a category of one–not just shaping the future of logistics but building what comes next. Prologis, Inc. was established in 1983 and is incorporated in Maryland.",
    "description_en": "Prologis, Inc. don't just lead the industry, they define it. The firm creates the intelligent infrastructure that powers global commerce, seamlessly connecting the digital and physical worlds. From agile supply chains to clean energy solutions, their ecosystems help your business move faster, operate smarter and grow sustainably. With unmatched scale, innovation and expertise, Prologis is a category of one–not just shaping the future of logistics but building what comes next. Prologis, Inc. was established in 1983 and is incorporated in Maryland.",
    "description_zh": "Prologis Inc. (普洛斯) 作為全球領先的物流不動產投資信託公司 (REIT)，其主要業務為全球商業活動提供智能化的物流基礎設施解決方案，旨在無縫整合數位與實體供應鏈。該公司透過開發、擁有及營運現代化倉儲、配送中心與物流園區，構成其核心不動產組合。\n\n普洛斯的營運模式，更著重於建立全面的物流不動產生態系統，應用數據分析、物聯網 (IoT) 等前瞻科技，將實體空間與數位營運緊密結合。其服務範疇不僅限於提供優質的物流空間，更延伸至能源管理、潔淨能源解決方案（如太陽能裝置）、運輸效率優化、以及勞動力支持等加值服務。藉由這套整合性平台，普洛斯旨在協助全球企業實現更敏捷、高效且具韌性的供應鏈運作，進而提升營運效率，並達成永續發展的策略目標。",
