    "image": "https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/AMT.png",
    "logo": "https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/AMT.png",
    "website": "https://www.americantower.com",
    "ceo": "Steven O. Vondran",
    "full_time_employees": "4866",
    "description": "American Tower Corporation is one of the largest global real estate investment trusts. It is a leading independent owner, operator and developer of multitenant communications real estate. The Company's primary business is the leasing of space on communications sites to wireless service providers, radio and television broadcast companies, wireless data providers, government agencies and municipalities and tenants in a few other industries. The Company refers to this business, inclusive of its data center business discussed below, as its property operations. Additionally, the Company offers tower-related services in the United States, which the Company refers to as its services operations. These services include site application, zoning and permitting, structural and mount analyses, and construction management services, together with program management offerings that support customer deployment needs from project scoping through construction. The Company's services operations primarily support the Company's site leasing business, including through the addition of new tenants and equipment on its sites. The Company's customers include its tenants, licensees and other payers. American Tower Corporation was incorporated in 1995 in Delaware and is based in Massachusetts, Boston.",
    "description_en": "American Tower Corporation is one of the largest global real estate investment trusts. It is a leading independent owner, operator and developer of multitenant communications real estate. The Company's primary business is the leasing of space on communications sites to wireless service providers, radio and television broadcast companies, wireless data providers, government agencies and municipalities and tenants in a few other industries. The Company refers to this business, inclusive of its data center business discussed below, as its property operations. Additionally, the Company offers tower-related services in the United States, which the Company refers to as its services operations. These services include site application, zoning and permitting, structural and mount analyses, and construction management services, together with program management offerings that support customer deployment needs from project scoping through construction. The Company's services operations primarily support the Company's site leasing business, including through the addition of new tenants and equipment on its sites. The Company's customers include its tenants, licensees and other payers. American Tower Corporation was incorporated in 1995 in Delaware and is based in Massachusetts, Boston.",
    "description_zh": "美國電塔公司 (American Tower Corporation, AMT) 是全球領先的不動產投資信託 (REITs) 之一。其為獨立擁有、營運及開發多租戶通訊不動產（如通訊基地台與鐵塔）的領導廠商。\n\nAMT 的核心業務板塊為「不動產營運」，主要係將其持有的多租戶通訊不動產空間（包含通訊基地台、鐵塔及數據中心設施）出租予無線服務供應商、廣播電視業者、無線數據供應業者、政府機構及市政單位等多元客戶群。此業務模式旨在透過提供共享基礎設施，最大化站點利用率與收益。\n\n此外，AMT 於美國市場亦提供「服務營運」板塊，內容涵蓋站點選址、規劃申請與許可、結構及設備安裝分析、施工管理，以及從專案規劃到建置完成的客戶部署專案管理服務。此服務板塊主要為支援其不動產營運業務，藉由協助客戶在新站點進行部署或在現有站點增設租戶與設備，以提升整體營運效益。",
