    "description": "Equinix, Inc. shortens the path to boundless connectivity anywhere in the world. Its digital infrastructure, data center footprint and interconnected ecosystems empower innovations that enhance our work, life and planet. Equinix connects economies, countries, organizations and communities, delivering seamless digital experiences and cutting-edge AI quickly, efficiently and everywhere. Equinix, Inc. was established on June 22, 1998 and is based in Redwood City, United States.",
    "description_en": "Equinix, Inc. shortens the path to boundless connectivity anywhere in the world. Its digital infrastructure, data center footprint and interconnected ecosystems empower innovations that enhance our work, life and planet. Equinix connects economies, countries, organizations and communities, delivering seamless digital experiences and cutting-edge AI quickly, efficiently and everywhere. Equinix, Inc. was established on June 22, 1998 and is based in Redwood City, United States.",
    "description_zh": "Equinix, Inc. (EQIX) 專注於建構全球領先的數位基礎設施服務。該公司透過遍佈全球的**資料中心據點 (Data Center Footprint)**，提供企業級的**主機代管 (Colocation)** 與**互連服務 (Interconnection Services)**。其核心營運模式為打造一個**高度互連的生態系統 (Interconnected Ecosystem)**，以縮短數位連結的物理距離，實現**無遠弗屆的連線能力 (Boundless Connectivity)**。\n\n此平台賦能客戶加速數位轉型、部署**尖端人工智慧 (AI) 應用**，並優化其數位體驗。Equinix 旨在串聯全球各經濟體、國家與組織，確保數據與應用能以高效、即時的方式流動，進而驅動各行各業的創新與發展，扮演全球數位經濟的關鍵樞紐角色。",
